|translation=Advance to kill the enemies, tighten the siege!<br>Advance into '''Saigon''', smash and crush the American foes!<br>Advancing toward '''Saigon''', we'll sweep away all enemies.<br>Heading toward the plain, we'll advance toward the metropolis.}}
#* {{quote-web|vi|work= w:Facebook|date= 1 October 2024|author= Sài Gòn|format= post
|url= https://www.facebook.com/saigoner.vn/posts/n%C3%B3i-1-c%C3%A2u-th%E1%BB%83-hi%E1%BB%87n-m%C3%ACnh-l%C3%A0-ng%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Di-s%C3%A0i-g%C3%B2n-ch%C3%ADnh-g%E1%BB%91c-%C4%91i-/99110106972363

