===Etymology===
{{vi-etym-sino|釋迦牟尼}}, from {{der|vi|lzh-lit|釋迦牟尼}}, transcribed from {{der|vi|sa|शाक्यमुनि|lit=Sage of the Shakyas}}. Compare {{cog|ja|釈迦牟尼|tr=Shakamuni}} and {{cog|ko|^석가모니}}.

