{{number box|vi}}
From {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*paː}}, from {{inh|vi|aav-pro|*peːʔ||three}}. Cognate with {{cog|mtq|pa}}, {{cog|km|បី}}, {{cog|hal|pe}}, {{cog|pac|pe}}, {{cog|mnw|ပိ}}, {{cog|sat|ᱯᱮ}}.

