biển.raw:
===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}
* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199 (vie)-Jessica Nguyen (Pamputt)-biển.wav|a=Ho Chi Minh City}}

===Etymology 1===
Perhaps from {{cog|mkh-vie-pro|*pes}}, representing a dialect where coda *s, *r, *l have merged with /n/, and *e diphthongized to /iə/. If so, cognate with, and have superseded [[bể]] as the common word for sea.

Compare [[về]], from *veːr, which is represented in some North Central dialects as viền.

====Noun====
{{vi-noun|[[㴜]], [[𤅶]], [[𣷷]]}}

# [[sea]]; [[ocean]]
