bèn.raw:
===Etymology===
{{vi-etym-sino|便||hv=n|tiện}}.

This word belongs to a group of post-reconstructed Old Chinese, pre-Middle Chinese loans in Vietnamese, showing both the correspondence of Vietnamese A tones ({{m|vi|ngang}}/{{m|vi|huyền}}) with Middle Chinese C tone (due to the loss of {{IPAfont|*-s}}) and the absence of palatalization in the onset, while the Sino-Vietnamese form from Late Middle Chinese shows the palatalization {{IPAfont|*bj- > t-}} and the tonal correspondance between Vietnamese B tones ({{m|vi|sắc}}/{{m|vi|nặng}}) and Sinitic tone C ({{m|vi|去}}).

===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}

===Adverb===
{{vi-adv|[[𠂫]], [[𠂪]], [[𲷵]]}}

# {{lb|vi|literary}} and [[so]] one does something; [[then]]; [[thereupon]]

===Particle===
{{vi-particle|[[卞]], [[𠂫]], [[𠂪]], [[𲏁]], [[⿰口弁]]}}

# {{lb|vi|obsolete|chiefly in translations of Chinese texts}} {{n-g|Used as an equivalent to {{zh-m|乃|tr=-}}, {{zh-m|爰|tr=-}}, {{zh-m|遂|tr=-}}, {{zh-m|即|tr=-}}/{{zh-m|卽|tr=-}}, {{zh-m|便|tr=-}}, or {{zh-m|聿|tr=-}}}}
## to [[be]]
##* {{zh-x|曰 喜 怒、曰 哀 樂。愛 惡 欲、'''乃''' 七情。|tr=Viết hỷ nộ, viết ai lạc. Ái ố dục, '''nãi''' thất tình.|It is talked about happiness and anger, of sorrow and joy. [And of] love, hate, and desire, which '''are''' the seven emotions.|ref=Sanzijing}}
<!-- These are the Vietnamese variants of the verses; the original verses in the Chinese SZJ are 曰喜怒、曰哀懼。愛惡欲、七情具。-->
##* {{quote-book|vi|termlang=vi|year=1888|title=vi:三字經解音演歌<tr:Tam tự kinh giải âm diễn ca><t:Versified Explanation of the Three Character Classic>|url=https://lib.nomfoundation.org/collection/1/volume/613/page/11|page=4b|passage=浪𢜠𫺶，浪傷𢝙。腰恄悶，'''卞'''𬙞情。|tr=Rằng mừng giận, rằng thương vui. Yêu, ghét, muốn, '''bèn''' bảy tình.|t=It is talked about happiness and anger, of sorrow and joy. [And of] love, hate, and desire, which '''are''' the seven emotions.}}
## [[then]]
##* {{zh-x|'''乃''' 習 文章|tr='''Nãi''' tập văn chương.|'''Then''' he studied literature and writing.|CL-VN|ref={{lang|zh|《初學問津》}}}}
##* {{quote-book|vi|year=1882|termlang=vi|title=vi:初學問津<tr:Sơ học vấn tân>|trans-title=Elementary Learning Inquiring About the Ford|page=16a|url=https://lib.nomfoundation.org/collection/1/volume/909/page/16|passage='''卞'''習文章。|tr='''Bèn''' tập văn chương.|t='''Then''' he studied literature and writing.}}
##* {{zh-x|蟋蟀 在 堂、 歲 '''聿''' 其 莫。|tr=Tất suất tại đường, tuế '''duật''' kỳ mộ.|The cricket is in the hall, and the year is drawing to a close.|ref=Shijing}}
##* {{quote-book|vi|year=1837|termlang=vi|title=vi:詩經演義<tr:Thi kinh diễn nghĩa>|trans-title=Explanation of the Meanings of the Classic of Poetry|volume=3|page=57|url=https://lib.nomfoundation.org/collection/3/volume/1419/page/57|passage=丐（⿰虫⿱艹已）𧓭於㙴茄，𫷜（'''⿰口弁'''）所侯闷。|tr=Cái dế mèn ở thềm nhà, năm '''bèn''' thửa hầu muộn.|t=The cricket is at the steps of the house, the year '''then''' is drawing to a close.}}
## [[thereupon]]
##* {{zh-x|'''爰''' 命 撰 訓迪 之 辭 凡 十 條|tr='''Viên''' mệnh soạn huấn địch chi từ phàm thập điều.|'''Thereupon''', [he] ordered the compilation of the instructive statements which totaled 10 clauses.|CL-VN|ref={{lang|zh|《皇朝聖諭訓迪十條》}}}}
##* {{quote-book|vi|year=1834|termlang=vi|title=vi:上諭訓條抄本解音<tr:Thượng dụ huấn điều sao bản giải âm>|trans-title=Copy of the Imperial Edict's Instructional Clauses explained in the National Pronunciation|page=4b|url=https://lib.nomfoundation.org/collection/1/volume/1175/page/5|passage='''卞'''遣撰蒸𠳒𠰺保凡𱑕條|tr='''Bèn''' khiến soạn chưng lời dạy bảo phàm mười điều.|t='''Thereupon''', [he] ordered the compilation of the instructive statements which totaled 10 clauses.}}
## [[therefore]]
##* {{zh-x|'''遂''' 因 賤 妾、密 寄 遙 情。|tr='''Toại''' nhân tiện thiếp, mật ký diêu tình.|'''Therefore''', through a lowly concubine, he secretly conveyed his distant affections.|CL-VN|ref={{lang|zh|《新編傳奇漫錄》}}}}
##* {{quote-book|vi|termlang=vi|year=1763|title=vi:新編傳奇漫錄增補解音集註<tr:Tân biên Truyền kỳ mạn lục tăng bổ giải âm tập chú>|trans-title=Newly Edited Collection of Truyền kỳ mạn lục with Supplemented Annotations, Phonetic Explanations, and Collected Notes|volume=2|chapter=vi:龍庭對訟錄<tr:Long đình đối tụng lục><t:The Tale of the Lawsuit in Dragon Court>|page=10b|url=https://lib.nomfoundation.org/collection/1/volume/77/page/91|passage='''卞'''因妾閑、冉改𢚸賒。|tr='''Bèn''' nhân thiếp hèn, nhẹm gửi lòng xa.|t='''Therefore''', through a lowly concubine, he secretly conveyed his distant affections.}}
## [[but]]
##* {{zh-x|不 見 子-充，'''乃''' 見 狡童。|tr=Bất kiến Tử Sung, '''nãi''' kiến giảo đồng.|I do not see Zichong, '''but''' I see this artful boy.|ref=Shijing}}
##* {{quote-book|vi|year=1837|termlang=vi|title=vi:詩經演義<tr:Thi kinh diễn nghĩa>|trans-title=Explanation of the Meanings of the Classic of Poetry|volume=3|page=13|url=https://lib.nomfoundation.org/collection/3/volume/1419/page/13|passage=𫽄𧡊𠌇子𠑽，'''卞'''𧡊侈𥘷坤。|tr=Chẳng thấy chàng Tử Sung, '''bèn''' thấy đứa trẻ khôn.|t=I do not see Zichong, '''but''' I see a clever boy.}}
## [[forthwith]], [[immediately]]
##* {{zh-x|'''即''' 厲 聲 曰|tr='''Tức''' lệ thanh viết.|[He] '''immediately''' said in a fierce voice.|CL-VN|ref={{lang|zh|《新編傳奇漫錄》}}}}
##* {{quote-book|vi|year=1763|termlang=vi|title=vi:新編傳奇漫錄增補解音集註<tr:Tân biên Truyền kỳ mạn lục tăng bổ giải âm tập chú>|trans-title=Newly Edited Collection of Truyền kỳ mạn lục with Supplemented Annotations, Phonetic Explanations, and Collected Notes|volume=1|chapter=vi:木棉樹傳<tr:Mộc miên thụ truyện><t:The Story of the Cotton Tree>|page=42b-43a|url=https://lib.nomfoundation.org/collection/1/volume/77/page/44|passage='''卞'''哿㗂浪|tr='''Bèn''' cả tiếng rằng.|t=[He] '''immediately''' said with his whole voice.}}

