===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}
* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199 (vie)-Penn Zero MSSJ-bông.wav|a=Hanoi}}
* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199 (vie)-Jessica Nguyen (Pamputt)-bông.wav|a=Ho Chi Minh City}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*poːŋ||[[flower]]}}. Cognate with {{cog|mtq|pông}} and {{cog|thm|โปง}}. Outside of Vietic, compare {{cog|mkh-pea-pro|*Pa(ː)ŋ}} (Headley, 1985), {{cog|mkh-kat-pro|*ʔmpɔɔŋ||banana blossom}}, {{cog|kns|həpuaŋ}}, {{cog|tnz|hapɔŋ}}.

This word had been tentatively proposed as being connected etymologically with Hmong-Mien ({{ncog|hmx-pro|*bi̯aŋ}}, whence {{ncog|ium|biangh}}, {{ncog|mww|paj}}) or Austronesian ({{ncog|map-pro|*buŋa}}, whence {{ncog|ms|bunga}} etc.) (for examples, Hsiu, 2017; H. Hayes, 1999, Hoàng Thị Châu, 2009). Ratliff (2017) connected the Hmong-Mien and Austronesian terms, but did not mention any Austroasiatic comparanda. In any case, the connection is not certain and might just be look-alikes.

====Noun====
{{vi-noun|[[芃]], [[𱽐]], [[𱣩]], [[𲸂]], [[葻]], [[𥟌]], [[𣒾]], [[𣜳]]}}

# {{lb|vi|central Vietnam|southern Vietnam}} [[bloom]]; [[flower]]
#: {{syn|vi|hoa}}
# [[cotton]]
#: {{uxi|vi|gấu '''bông'''|a cotton-stuffed bear}}

====Classifier====
{{vi-cls|[[芃]], [[葻]], [[𱽐]], [[𱣩]], [[𣒾]], [[𣜳]]}}

# {{n-g|Indicates flowers.}}
#: {{syn|vi|đoá}}

====Usage notes====
* Although ''bông'' in the sense of "flower" has mostly been displaced by {{m|vi|hoa}} in the Northern dialects, {{m|vi|lúa||rice plant}} is an exception in that it is most often only accompanied by ''bông'' (i.e. '''''bông''' lúa'', ''lúa trổ '''bông''''', etc.) and not ''hoa'', regardless of the dialect.

====Derived terms====
{{col|vi|pháo bông|bông tuyết|gấu bông|thú bông|gấu nhồi bông|thú nhồi bông}}

===Etymology 2===
