băng.raw:
===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}
* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199_(vie)-Jessica_Nguyen_(Pamputt)-băng.wav|a=Ho Chi Minh City}}

===Etymology 1===
{{vi-etym-sino|冰}}. Quite recently displaced native {{m|vi|giá}}, now found chiefly in compounds.

Compare this ''diễn nghĩa'' example from ''Hiếu kinh diễn nghĩa'', written in Southern Vietnamese:
: {{quote-book|zh|year=4th century {{BCE}} (original Chinese)|author=anonymous|title=Hiếu Kinh 孝經|text={{vi-ruby|詩云戰戰兢兢如臨深淵如履薄'''冰'''|thi vân chiến chiến căng căng như lâm thâm uyên như lí bạc '''băng'''}}|t=It is said in the Book of Poetry: Be apprehensive, be cautious, as if on the brink of a deep abyss, as if treading on thin '''ice'''.}} <!-- I wonder if I should keep the accompanying annotations by Trương Minh Ký, obvious Southerisms like nhơn clearly should be kept, but 兢兢 as "căn căn" here instead of căng căng is clearly due to /n/-/ŋ/ merger. -->
:: {{quote-book|vi|year=1893 (''diễn nghĩa'')|author=''diễn nghĩa'' by {{lw|vi|Trương Minh Ký}}|title=Hiếu kinh diễn nghĩa|text=Thi rằng: E lệ lo âu, như sang '''giá''' mỏng vực sâu khác gì!|translation=It is said in the Book of Poetry: Be apprehensive, be cautious, as if treading on thin '''ice''' and crossing deep abyss.}}
See also this example from ''Nam học Hán văn khoá bản'', written in Northern Vietnamese.
: {{quote-book|vi|author=Nguyễn Can Mộng|title=Nam học Hán văn khoá bản|year=1920|chapter=Bài 12|passage=冰 '''Băng'''=giá, ''la glace''.|translation=冰 '''Băng'''=ice, ''la glace''.}}

