bảy bảy bốn chín ngày.raw:
===Etymology===
From {{der|vi|zh|七七日|tr=thất thất nhật||[[seven]] [[day]]s [[times]] [[seven]]}} and {{m|zh|四十九日|tr=tứ thập cửu nhật||[[forty-nine]] days}}. "Seven" is as in "7 {{w|Hun and po|po}}" (see also {{m|vi|ba hồn bảy vía}}) and "7 days of the week". Each of the three "{{w|Hun and po|hun}}" leaves the body after each of the next 3 years, while each of the seven "po" leaves after every 7 days, which results in a larger memorial offering after 49 days and the ultimate end of mourning after 3 years.

