bật.raw:
===Etymology===
{{rfe|vi|I have seen the proposal that this word is a byform of the predecessor form of {{m|vi|trật}} (< earlier onset {{IPAfont|*b-l-}}). While the sound shift is not unheard of (cf. modern {{m|vi|mác}}, from Middle Vietnamese {{m|mkh-mvi|mlác}}), I'm not too sure the two words can be connected so readily. The fact that this word is so strangely absent from most Nôm texts (for a common verb) do favor the hypothesis that it's a rather recent byform though.}}

===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}

===Verb===
{{vi-verb|弼}}

# {{lb|vi|intransitive}} to [[bounce off]]; to [[bounce back]]
#: {{ux|vi|Trái banh nó quăng '''bật''' thẳng lại vô mặt nó.|The ball that he threw bounced right back into his own face.}}
# {{lb|vi|transitive}} to [[snap]]; to [[switch on]] (lights)
#: {{ant|vi|tắt}}
#: {{ux|vi|Phòng sao tối um vậy? Ai '''bật''' đèn lên coi?|This room is pitch-black, can someone just turn the light on?}}
# {{lb|vi|intransitive}} to [[feature]] [[prominently]]
#: {{uxi|vi|điều đó làm '''bật''' lên một vấn đề khác|that just '''highlights''' another problem}}
# to do something [[suddenly]]
