|passage=Thuyền ai đậu '''bến''' sông trăng đó,<br>Có chở trăng về kịp tối nay?
|translation=Someone's boat is moored at the moon[lit] river's '''shore''' there,<br>Shall it take the moon[light] back timely tonight?}}
