#: {{uxi|vi|'''Bến''' xe Miền Đông|{{w|Mien Dong Coach Station|Mien Dong Coach '''Station'''}}}}

====Usage notes====
* On land, large {{m|vi|bến}}, such as Ho Chi Minh City's ''Mien Dong Coach Station'', are stations where coaches and coach-vans used for inter-province travel can also park. Smaller {{m|vi|bến}} are only specialized for numbered buses, carts and autorickshaws used for in-province travel or commute.
