bủh.raw:
===Etymology===
In the [[Telex]] input method, mistyping {{m|en|bruh}} as <kbd>burh</kbd> produces "bủh". Riffs off the preexisting borrowing {{m|vi|bro}}, which itself flouts Vietnamese spelling rules. Popularized by the meme Bruh.<ref>{{cite-journal|title='Dảk và Bủh' là gì và vì sao nó lại được yêu thích đến thế trên Internet?|trans-title=What are "Dảk and Bủh" and why are they liked so much on the Internet?|author=DS|work=GameK|publisher=VCCorp|location=Hanoi|date=2021-03-02|accessdate=2023-03-07|url=https://gamek.vn/dak-va-buh-la-gi-va-vi-sao-no-lai-duoc-yeu-thich-den-the-tren-internet-20210302184700225.chn}}</ref> Ultimately a shortening of {{bor|vi|en|brother}} from [[African-American Vernacular English]].

===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA|bủ|bRờ}}

===Pronoun===
{{vi-pronoun}}

# {{lb|vi|Internet slang|Vietnam}} {{eye dialect of|vi|bruh}}

===See also===
* {{l|en|dảk}}

===References===
{{reflist}}

