====Usage notes====
* As a classifier, ''chiếc'' is usually considered as a formal, or even literary, counterpart to {{m|vi|cái}}. It is mostly used colloquially when indicating some types of vehicles such as bicycles, motorcycles, cars, etc.
* Using ''chiếc'' deliberately with a noun it typically doesn't pair with can produce a [[slang]]ish construction for [[comedic]] or [[playful]] effect. For example:
** {{quote-web|vi|work= w:Facebook|date=2021-05-22|author=Trúng tim cậu chưa?|format= post
|url= https://web.facebook.com/bantimne/posts/nh%E1%BB%AFng-chi%E1%BA%BFc-m%C3%A8o-h%C3%A0i-h%C6%B0%E1%BB%9Bc-/512837906824235/?_rdc=1&_rdr#
|text= Những '''chiếc''' mèo hài hước =))
|translation= [[funni|Funni]] cats =)) }}
** {{quote-web|vi|work= w:Thread|date=2025-04-01|author=nhanmoc|format= post
|url= https://www.threads.com/@nhanmoc/post/DH54uppBuV_
|text= Một '''chiếc''' cà phê núp hẻm ở Vũng Tàu
|translation= A [cutie] café hidden in the alley in Vũng Tàu}}
** {{quote-web|vi|work= w:Facebook|date=2025-07-16|author=Đài English|format= post
|url= https://web.facebook.com/daienglish.sound/posts/chi%E1%BA%BFc-meme-huy%E1%BB%81n-tho%E1%BA%A1i-m%E1%BB%99t-th%E1%BB%9Di-n%C3%A0y-k-bi%E1%BA%BFt-n%C4%83m-nay-c%C3%B3-b%E1%BB%8B-so%C3%A1n-ng%C3%B4i-k-%C4%91%C3%A2y-/753474150376185/?_rdc=1&_rdr#
|text= '''Chiếc''' meme huyền thoại một thời này k biết năm nay có bị soán ngôi k đây :)))))))))))))))))
|translation= [I wonder] if this once legendary meme could even be toppled this year :)))))))))))))))))}}
* Note that only ''cái'' can be used to indicate zoological body parts, except for teeth.

