chăng.raw:
===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}

===Etymology 1===
The chief negator in earlier stages of Vietnamese up to the fourteenth century.<ref>{{quote-book|en|author=Trang Phan|title=Studies in Vietnamese Historical Linguistics|chapter=The Rise of Negative Markers in Vietnamese: Evidence from Primary Nôm Texts|passage=Stage 1 (up to thirteenth century): Chăng is used as the standard negative marker. Chăng often co-occurs with the existential verb có. Không is a lexical element meaning ‘space’ or ‘empty’. Stage 2 (up to fourteenth century): Chăng continues to be used as the standard negative marker. Chăng continues to collocate with the existential verb có. Không emerges as a functional element preceding nouns with negative meaning ‘not.have’.|year=2024|doi=10.1007/978-981-97-4314-8_3|author2=Tuan-Cuong Nguyen|author3=Masaaki Shimizu}}</ref>

====Adverb====
{{vi-adv|[[庄]], [[庒]], [[𠲕]]}}

# {{lb|vi|archaic}} [[not]] [[any]], [[not]] [[even]]
#* {{RQ:Nguyen Trai Quoc am thi tap|chapter=言志 Ngôn chí 1}}
#*: {{ux|vi|盃固蔑念'''庒'''女豸<br/>道濫昆免道濫碎|tr=Bui có một niềm '''chăng''' nỡ trại,<br/>Đạo làm con miễn đạo làm tôi.|I only have this one sentiment: I dare '''not even''' neglect<br/>My duty as a child and my duty as a subject.}}<!---I think reading 庒 here as chăng is preferable to as chẳng; reading 庒 as chăng would yield the tone pattern 平仄仄平平仄仄 for line 7, which would complement line 8's 仄平平仄仄平平; while reading 庒 as chẳng would yield 平仄仄平仄仄仄 (!)--->
# {{lb|vi|often in [[rhetorical question]]s}} [[is]] [[it]] [[that]]; is it; [[surely]]
#* {{quote-book|vi|year=1739|title=胡尚書家禮<tr:Hồ thượng thư gia lễ>|page=2b|url=https://archive.org/details/ho-thuong-thu-gia-le/page/321/mode/2up|passage=𠳨㝵固唄（⿰口𱘷）之'''庄'''時筆紙曰如（⿰口𱘷）㝵唄渚差蔑（⿰口𱘷）底户行特㨿於朱和順|tr=Hỏi người có trối lời gì '''chăng''', thì bút giấy viết như lời người trối, chớ sai một lời, để họ hàng được cứ ở cho hòa thuận.|t=If you ask the person whether they have any final words, then write them down on paper exactly as they are spoken, do not make a single mistake, so that the relatives may continue living together in harmony.}}
#* {{quote-journal|vi|title=Có hoàn cảnh văn chương nào khốc liệt như ở Việt Nam chăng?|url=https://tuoitre.vn/co-hoan-canh-van-chuong-nao-khoc-liet-nhu-o-viet-nam-chang-20180118090621812.htm|newspaper=Tuổi Trẻ Online|date=18 Jan 2018
|passage=Có hoàn cảnh văn chương nào khốc liệt như ở Việt Nam '''chăng'''?
|translation=Is there a literary situation as fierce as that in Vietnam?}}

