chơ.raw:
===Etymology===
Cognate {{cog|mtq|chớ}} ~ {{m|mtq|chở}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{vi-ipa}}

===Particle===
{{vi-particle}}

# {{lb|vi|North Central Vietnam}} {{n-g|expressing contrast with the previous clause}}, equivalent [[but]], [[than]].
#: {{ux|vi|Ưng tiếng Trung Kỳ '''chơ''' nỏ ưng tiếng Bấc Kỳ.|I like the Central dialect '''but''' not the Northern dialect.}}
# {{lb|vi|North Central Vietnam}} {{n-g|after ''chơ'' express doubt about the previous clause (if any).}}
#: {{ux|vi|'''Chơ''' răng nựa!|What else?}}
#: {{ux|vi|Tam nên nhởi ở cươi banh '''chơ''' răng nhởi cươi tràng?|You should play in the soccer field, why play in the school yard?}}
# {{lb|vi|North Central Vietnam}} {{n-g|at the end of a question, shows whether the assertion is true or not and you want to confirm that is correct.}}
#: {{ux|vi|O giáo giảng bài dể hỉu '''chơ'''?|The teacher's lesson is easy to understand, '''right'''?}}
# {{lb|vi|North Central Vietnam}} {{n-g|at the end of a statement, emphasize that the statement is true.}}
#: {{ux|vi|Ăn '''chơ'''! Ngon ri răng nỏ ăn!|Eat up! It's so good, you've got to try it!}}
#: {{ux|vi|Théc phẩy treo mùng '''chơ'''! Mọi đút răng!|You must sleep under a mosquito net, or else the mosquitoes will bite.}}

chăng là chẳng.raw:
[[File:Chăng là chẳng glossing.png|thumb|Chăng là chẳng glossed here in Thi kinh đại toàn tiết yếu 詩經大全節要 (1846). On the right, it reads "Chăng là chẳng có đức lành" (庄𪜀拯固德苓) "There was no one who did not have good virtue."]]

===Etymology===
From {{af|vi|chăng|là|chẳng|t1=not any|t2=to be|t3=not; no}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}

===Noun===
{{vi-noun|[[庄羅拯]], [[拯𦉼拯]], [[庄𦉼庄]], [[庄𱺵𫽄]], [[庄𪜀拯]]}}

# {{lb|vi|obsolete|chiefly in translations of Chinese texts}} there was no one who didn't
#* {{zh-x|見 而 民 '''莫不''' 敬|tr=Hiện nhi dân '''mạc bất''' kính.|He is seen, and the people '''all''' reverence him.|ref=Liji-L}}
#* {{quote-book|vi|termlang=vi|year=1839|title=四書約解中庸解國音義增補大全備旨<tr:Tứ thư ước giải Trung Dung giải quốc âm nghĩa tăng bổ đại toàn bị chỉ>|trans-title=Concise Explanations of the Four Books: Explanation of the Doctrine of the Mean in National Pronunciation with Meanings, Supplementary Additions, and a Complete Compilation of Essential Points|volume=2|page=31b|url=https://archive.org/details/tu-thu-uoc-giai-gia-ab.-270-1/page/n117/mode/2up|passage=烈𦷾麻民'''庄羅拯'''敬|tr=Rệt đấy mà dân '''chăng là chẳng''' kính.|t=[He] is seen and among the people, '''there was no one who didn't''' respect [him].}}
#* {{zh-x|'''罔不''' 秉德 明恤， 小臣 屏 侯 甸， 矧 咸 奔走。|tr='''Võng bất''' bỉnh đức minh tuất, tiểu thần bình hầu điện, thẩn hàm bôn tẩu.|The various heads of great surnames and members of the royal House, holding employments, '''all''' held fast their virtue, and showed an anxious solicitude (for the kingdom). The smaller ministers, and the guardian princes in the Hou and Dian domains, hurried about on their services.|ref=Shangshu-L}}
#* {{quote-book|vi|termlang=vi|year=1837|title=vi:書經大全節要演義<tr:Thư kinh đại toàn tiết yếu diễn nghĩa>|trans-title=An Explanation (in Vietnamese) of the Selected Essentials from the Complete Collection of the Book of Documents|chapter=vi:君奭<tr:Quân Thích><t:Prince Shi>|volume=5|page=40b|url=https://www0.kfzimg.com/sw/kfz-cos/kfzimg/dacdaced/68ca73d0273d7b18_b.jpg|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20260728055928/https://www0.kfzimg.com/sw/kfz-cos/kfzimg/dacdaced/68ca73d0273d7b18_b.jpg|passage='''庄𱺵𫽄'''扲所德𱏮役𠰷，外時碎（⿰豸小）共渃潘笤於隊侯像甸，方之調𧼌|tr='''Chăng là chẳng''' cầm thửa đức sáng việc lo, ngoài thì tôi nhỏ cùng nước phên giậu ở đội hầu tuồng điện, phương chi đều chạy.|t='''There was none who didn't''' uphold virtue and concern themselves to affairs. Even the minor officials and the feudal lords in the Hou and Dian domains, futhermore they all hasten to carry out their duties.}}
# {{lb|vi|obsolete|chiefly in translations of Chinese texts}} none other than
#* {{zh-x|天數 安排 '''莫非''' 前定|tr=Thiên số an bài '''mạc phi''' tiền định.|The arrangements of heaven are '''none other than''' predetermined.|CL-VN|ref={{lang|zh|《新編傳奇漫錄》}}}}
#* {{quote-book|vi|termlang=vi|year=1774|title=新編傳奇漫錄增補解音集註<tr:Tân biên Truyền kỳ mạn lục tăng bổ giải âm tập chú>|trans-title=Newly Edited Collection of Truyền kỳ mạn lục with Supplemented Annotations, Phonetic Explanations, and Collected Notes|volume=1|page=27a|url=https://archive.org/details/tan-bien-truyen-ky-man-luc-tang-bo-giai-am-tap-chu-vhv.-1491/page/n27/mode/2up|passage=數𡗶安達'''庄羅拯'''𨎠定|tr=Số trời an đặt '''chăng là chẳng''' trước định.|t=The arrangements of heaven are '''none other than''' predetermined.}}

