chưng.raw:
===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}

===Etymology 1===
{{vi-etym-sino|張|to set out, to display|preMC=y|trương}}. {{doublet|vi|trưng|trương}}.

====Verb====
{{vi-verb}}

# to [[show off]], to [[sport]]

====See also====
{{col|vi|chưng diện}}

===Etymology 2===
{{vi-etym-sino|蒸|steam}}.

====Verb====
{{vi-verb}}

# to [[distill]]

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|vi|chưng cất}}

===Etymology 3===
In pre-modern writing of a more colloquial nature and original works, ''chưng'' was used as a preposition to indicate place and time. However, this particle/preposition was also a literary device widely used in translation of Chinese texts, as a "stand-in" of sort for such Chinese markers as {{m|zh|之}}, {{m|zh|夫|tr=fú}}, etc. See Washizawa (2017) for more information.

====Particle====
{{vi-particle|[[烝]], [[蒸]], [[徵]], [[𳃬]]}}

# {{lb|vi|obsolete}} [[in]]; [[on]]; [[at]]
#* {{quote-book|vi|year= late 17th - early 18th c. {{CE}}|title=vi:天南語籙外紀<tr:Thiên Nam ngữ lục ngoại kỷ>|trans-title=Peripheral Records of Excerpts from Thiên Nam|url=https://archive.org/details/thien-nam-ngu-ngoai-ky-ab.-478/page/n70/mode/1up|page=63b
|text=媄南昆北求生<br>碎俸蔑𠇮落典'''蒸'''低|tr=Mẹ nam, con bắc cầu sinh,<br>Tôi bỗng một mình lạc đến '''chưng''' đây.|t=My mother in the south, her son in the north, both seeking survival.<br>I suddenly was left alone, got lost, and ended up '''at''' this place.}}
# {{lb|vi|obsolete}} [[due to]]; [[because]]
#* {{quote-book|vi|year=1922|title=vi:阮堂家譜序<tr:Nguyễn Đường gia phả tự>|trans-title=Preface to the Nguyễn Đường Genealogy|page=2a|url=https://lib.nomfoundation.org/collection/1/volume/309/page/2|passage=嘗𦖑：滝𨱽𣷭𢌌，𪽝'''蒸'''𤂬瀋源溇|tr=Thường nghe, sông dài bể rộng, bởi '''chưng''' suối thẳm nguồn sâu.|t=It is said that: rivers are long and oceans are wide, this is '''because''' the stream is far-reaching and the source is deep.}}
# {{lb|vi|obsolete|chiefly in translations of Chinese texts}} {{ng|Used as an equivalent to {{zh-m|夫|tr=-}}, {{zh-m|凡|tr=-}}, {{zh-m|其|tr=-}}, {{zh-m|之|tr=-}}, {{zh-m|[[於]]/[[于]]|tr=-}}, or {{zh-m|[[諸]]|tr=-}} {{gl|contracted from {{zh-m|[[之]][[於]]/[[之]][[于]]}}}}}}
## [[of]] (belonging to) 
##: {{syn|vi|của}}
##* {{zh-x|父子 '''之''' 綱、又 安在 㢤。|tr=Phụ tử '''chi''' cương, hựu an tại tai?|The bond (relationship) '''of''' father and son, where is it now?|CL-VN|ref={{lang|zh|《新編傳奇漫錄》}}}}
##* {{quote-book|vi|termlang=vi|year=1763|title=vi:新編傳奇漫錄增補解音集註<tr:Tân biên Truyền kỳ mạn lục tăng bổ giải âm tập chú>|trans-title=Newly Edited Collection of Truyền kỳ mạn lục with Supplemented Annotations, Phonetic Explanations, and Collected Notes|volume=1|chapter=vi:項王祠記<tr:Hạng vương từ ký><t:The Record at Xiang King's Temple>|page=13a|url=https://lib.nomfoundation.org/collection/1/volume/77/page/14|passage='''蒸'''𦀚吒昆、吏於兠丕台。|tr='''Chưng''' giềng cha con, lại ở đâu vậy thay?|t=The bond (relationship) '''of''' father and son, where is it now?}}
## [[in]]; [[at]]
##: {{syn|vi|ở}}
##* {{zh-x|難 轉 難 廻 徃徃 漂沉 '''于''' 苦海|tr=Nan chuyển nan hồi vãng vãng phiêu trầm '''vu''' khổ hải.|Difficult to turn, difficult to return, constantly sinking '''in''' the sea of suffering.|CL-VN|ref={{lang|zh|《課虛録》}}}}
##* {{quote-book|vi|termlang=vi|year=14th century|title=vi:太宗皇帝御製課虛録<tr:Thái Tông hoàng đế ngự chế khoá hư lục>|volume_plain=upper volume|page=6a|url=https://archive.org/details/thai-tong-hoang-de-ngu-che-khoa-hu-luc/page/201/mode/2up|passage=坤轉身坤𧗱頭，恒〱調𤐝溂'''蒸'''凖𣷭庫。|tr=Khôn chuyển thân khôn về đầu, hằng hằng đều trôi dạt '''chưng''' chốn bể khó.|t=Difficult to turn back the body, difficult to return to the beginning, constantly drifting and sinking '''in''' the sea of suffering.}}
## {{ng|pronoun}}; [[that]]
##* {{zh-x|若'''夫''' 天曹 之 遊，其 有 其 無，何必 深 辨。|tr=Nhược '''phù''' thiên tào chi du, kỳ hữu kỳ vô, hà tất thâm biện?|As for '''that''' [matter], [going up to] play in the celestial office, whether it exists or does not exist, why one must dispute deeply about that?|CL-VN|ref={{lang|zh|《新編傳奇漫錄》}}}}
##* {{quote-book|vi|termlang=vi|year=1763|title=vi:新編傳奇漫錄增補解音集註<tr:Tân biên Truyền kỳ mạn lục tăng bổ giải âm tập chú>|trans-title=Newly Edited Collection of Truyền kỳ mạn lục with Supplemented Annotations, Phonetic Explanations, and Collected Notes|volume=2|chapter=vi:范子虛遊天曹錄<tr:Phạm Tử Hư du thiên tào lục><t:The Tale of Phạm Tử Hư Visiting Heaven>|page=78a|url=https://lib.nomfoundation.org/collection/1/volume/77/page/159|passage=朋'''烝'''制准天曹，所固所空，牢乙瀋盤泊。|tr=Bằng '''chưng''' chơi chốn thiên tào, thửa có thửa không, sao ắt thẳm bàn bạc?|t=As for '''that''' [matter], [going up to] play in the celestial office, whether it exists or does not exist, why one must discuss this so deeply?}}
