===Etymology===
From {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*ɟalʔ}}, from {{inh|vi|mkh-pro|*ɟarʔ||quick, to run}}. Cognate with {{cog|kpm|jar||quick, hurry}} and {{cog|sea|jar||to run}}.

