===Particle===
{{vi-particle}}

# {{n-g|Compares a predicate or clause stated before it to its supposed alternative, which is nullified in the predicate or clause after. Provides clarification, or implies high credibility, of either or both clauses (or predicates).}}
#: {{ux|vi|Nó thà chết '''chứ''' không khai.|He'd rather die '''than''' testify, '''I'm telling you'''.}}
#: {{ux|vi|Mày giỏi trò ăn nói với bạn bè, '''chứ''' có biết gì về chuyện vợ chồng đâu mà đi dạy người ta.|You're good at socialising with friends, '''but''' not that much about the affairs of marriage '''to teach people (about it)'''.}}
#: {{ux|vi|Thầy nói thế thôi, '''chứ''' người ta hơi đâu mà phạt mày kiểu đấy.|t=The teacher was just bluffing,''' no''' one has the commitment to punish you that way.}}
#: {{ux|vi|Tôi giỏi chịu đựng thôi, '''chứ''' thật ra vẫn biết đau.|I just cope with it well, '''but''' I still feel pain.}}
#: {{ux|vi|Họ chơi như thế là còn nhẹ tay, '''chứ''' họ đánh thật có khi phải mười-không|Them playing like that is still merciful, '''had''' they gone all out, it would have been ten-nill.}}
# {{n-g|if what comes after is an interrogative word or phrase, implies that you highly doubt there is any alternative to an affirmative answer of the question}}
#: {{ux|vi|'''Chứ''' mày nghĩ tao lên trường làm gì ?|'''Wait''', what'd you think I went to the school for?}}
#: {{ux|vi|'''Chứ''' theo ông thì tôi phải làm thế nào ?|What do you think I should've done '''then'''?}}
#: {{ux|vi|'''Chứ sao''' !|Of course! '''What else could it be then'''?}}
#: {{ux|vi|Thằng Tú vứt '''chứ ai vào đây''' ! Nó suốt ngày chê cái ghế làm xấu mặt tiền nhà mình.|Of course Tú threw it away, '''who else then'''? He always complained how that chair was an eyesore in front of our house.}}
# {{n-g|at the end of a question, hints that you think what you have said before this particle is true, although you still want to confirm it}}
#: {{ux|vi|Ông già mày còn sống đấy '''chứ''' ?|Your old man's still alive, '''yes'''?}}
# {{n-g|at the end of a statement, affirms what comes before this particle and hints that you think your conversation partner was too clueless about it}}
#: {{ux|vi|Có thế '''chứ''' ! Đàn ông đàn ang phải biết làm việc nặng.|That's what I'm talkin' about! You're a man, you're supposed to be able to handle heavy jobs like this.}}
#: {{ux|vi|Khẽ '''chứ''' ! Cu Tí đang ngủ !|Quiet! Baby Tí's sleeping!}}
#: {{ux|vi|Người ta cũng biết tiếng Anh '''chứ bộ''' !|'''In case you didn't know''', I do speak some English!}}

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|at the end of a question}} {{vi-l|phải không}}, {{vi-l|đúng không}}

