|text= '''Cái''' [[bống|Bống]] là '''cái''' Bống bang<br>Khéo sảy khéo sàng cho mẹ nấu cơm
|t= Li'l '''miss''' Goby, O li'l '''miss''' Goby,<br>Skillfully sieves rice for Mommy to cook.
|url= https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dRtUsHSNFQY}}
# {{lb|vi|of [[gambling]] [[session]]s or [[cardplay]]s}} [[banker]], [[dealer]] or [[keeper]]
#: {{uxi|vi|làm '''cái'''; cầm '''cái'''|to act as a '''gamemaster''' for such games}}
