# {{lb|vi|by extension|of a community's [[savings]] [[pot]] {{q|called '''{{m|vi|họ}}''', '''{{m|vi|bát họ}}''' or '''{{m|vi|hụi}}'''}}}} [[keeper]]
# {{syn of|vi|gái}}
# {{lb|vi|obsolete}} [[mother]]

