{{rfe|vi}}

For the "penis" sense, compare {{ncog|en|cock}}, {{ncog|zh|鳥|tr=điểu||bird}} and {{m|zh|屌|tr=điểu||[[penis]]}}, {{cog|th|นกเขา||pigeon, dove}}. See also {{m|vi|cu||pigeon}}, {{m|vi|chim||bird}}.

For the "boy" sense, see also {{m|vi|cu||pigeon}}.

For the "trigger" sense, compare {{ncog|ms|pelatuk||woodpecker, trigger}}, {{ncog|en|cock||hammer of firearm}}.

====Noun====
{{vi-noun|cls=con|[[𫛈]], [[𪂲]], [[鷺]], [[𪂮]], [[孤]]}}

