{{vi-etym-sino|機|mechanic, machine|學|study|suffix=học}}. Probably a calque from a European language, compare {{ncog|km|យន្តសាស្ត្រ}}, {{ncog|th|กลศาสตร์}}, both mean "science/study of machines".

Note that the etymological equivalent of {{ncog|zh|力學}}, {{ncog|ko|역학}}, {{ncog|ja|力学|tr=rikigaku}}, in Vietnamese (''*lực học'') is pretty much not used in isolation (although it occurs in names of branches of mechanics like {{vi-link|động lực học|dynamics|動力學}}).

