#* {{quote-book|vi|year=1914|title=南國方言俗語備錄<tr:Nam quốc phương ngôn tục ngữ bị lục><t:Records of the Southern Nation's regional adages and common sayings>|url=https://lib.nomfoundation.org/collection/1/volume/74/page/16|page=16a|passage=穉'''𢚁'''吒𫅷'''𢚁'''𡥵|tr=Trẻ '''cậy''' cha, già '''cậy''' con.|t=When young, one '''relies on''' one's father; when old, one '''relies on''' one's child.}}
#* {{circa|53 - 54}}, {{w|First Epistle to the Corinthians|1 Corinthians}} 13:13; '''2011''' Vietnamese translation from KPA version; '''2021''' English translation from the {{w|New Revised Standard Version#NRSV Updated Edition (NRSVue)|New Revised Standard Version Updated Edition}}
#*: {{ux|vi|2= Hiện nay đức tin, {{comment|2=Greek original 'ἐλπίς'|1=đức '''cậy}}''', đức mến, cả ba đều tồn tại, nhưng cao trọng hơn cả là đức mến.|t= And now faith, {{comment|2=Greek original 'ἐλπίς'|1='''hope'''}}, and love remain, these three, and the greatest of these is love.}}
# {{lb|vi|by extension}} to pride oneself (on); to [[plume]] oneself (on); to congratulate oneself (on)
#: {{uxi|vi|'''cậy''' là mình [with adjective]|to '''bank on''' oneself being [with adjective]}}
#: {{uxi|vi|'''cậy''' là mình [with verb]|to '''bank on''' that one [with verb]}}
#* {{quote-book|vi|origlang= zh|year= 1909|origyear= 14th century|author= w:Luo Guanzhong|translator= {{lw|vi|Phan Kế Bính}}|title= w:Romance of the Three Kingdoms|chapter= 78
|text= {{lw|vi|Quan Vũ|Quan-công}} [[xưa nay]] tính cương quá mà hay '''cậy''' mình khỏe, nên mới có vạ này.
|translation= {{w|Guan Yu|Lord Guan}} hitherto was too headstrong and often prided himself on his strength; therefore this calamity befell him.}}
#* {{quote-book|vi|year= 1921|origyear= 1794|title= {{lw|vi|Lĩnh Nam dật sử}}|trans-title= Lost History of Lingnan|original= 嶺南逸史|author= Huang Yan (黃岩)|translator= {{lw|vi|Nguyễn Hữu Tiến}}|chapter= 22
|text= Lai Đắc tự hiệu là Phi-thiên ngô-công, hay đứng ở trên mình ngựa múa thanh đại-đao nặng ba trăm cân, xưa nay vẫn tự '''cậy''' là khỏe, vốn không hiệp với Lam Năng.
|translation= Lai Đắc styled himself the Flying Centipede, often stood on his horse and flourished his three-hundred-catty-heavy great glaive; hitherto, he always prided himself on his strength, and never got along with Lam Năng.}}
#* {{quote-web|vi|work= vov.vn|date= 19 February 2014|title= Chồng lo vun vén của riêng, bỏ mặc vợ con|trans-title= Husband busily hoarding own wealth, neglecting wife and children
|url= https://vov.vn/tinh-yeu-gia-dinh/chong-lo-vun-ven-cua-rieng-bo-mac-vo-con-311239.vov
|text= Chồng tôi gia trưởng, bảo thủ và ích kỷ, chỉ nghĩ cho bản thân mình, lúc nào anh ấy cũng '''cậy''' là mình có tiền.
|translation= My husband is despotic, conservative, and selfish, only thinking about himself; he always plumes himself on having money.}}

