#: {{ux|vi|Nghiên cứu về các chế định trong '''dân luật'''.|Researching the institutions within '''civil law'''.}}

====Usage notes====
* In comparative law, '''dân luật''' refers to the "Civil Law" family (also known as the Romano-Germanic or Continental legal system). 

* While '''dân luật''' can refer to the branch of law, the term {{m|vi|luật dân sự}} is much more commonly used in modern Vietnamese legal practice to refer to the specific branch or the Civil Code.

