===Etymology===
From {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*-taːlʔ}}, from {{inh|vi|mkh-pro|*kt₁aal||under-surface, under}} (Shorto 2006, #1735). Cognate with {{cog|omx|kintāl}} (modern Mon {{m|mnw|ဂတာ|tr=həta||underpart, bottom}}).

The Northern Old Vietnamese form is attested in ''Phật thuyết đại báo phụ mẫu ân trọng kinh'' (佛說大報父母恩重經) as {{m|vi|𢃄}}, phonetic {{ltc-l|帶}} (modern [[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|đái}}), showing that the shift {{IPAfont|*-l > -j}} in these dialects had already happened.

