===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*k-toːʔ||trace, footprint}}; compare North Central Vietnamese {{m|vi|đấu}}, {{cog|scb|-}} [Rục] ''kataw³'' and {{cog|aem|-}} ''dawˀ''. The meaning "tone" is due to the fact that tones are usually marked with diacritics.

