già.raw:
===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|vi|tra|q1=North Central Vietnam}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*k-raː}}, from {{inh|vi|mkh-pro|*kraʔ}} ~ {{m|mkh-pro|*(k)rah}}. Cognate with {{cog|mtq|khà}}, {{cog|tou|-}} [Cuối Chăm] ''kʰraː¹'', {{cog|bdq|kră}}.

Attested as Northern {{cog|mkh-mvi|già}} in the ''Dictionarium Annamiticum Lusitanum et Latinum'' (1651), a dictionary based chiefly on the Northern dialects. The modern North Central form descended from an unattested Middle Vietnamese form, which derived from an unattested non-Northern Old Vietnamese form.

The standard written Vietnamese form is irregular (the expected form would be ''**sa''), while the North Central form shows the shift from {{IPAfont|*k-r}} to {{IPAfont|*k-l}} observable in several other instances: compare {{m|vi|sâu}} and {{m|vi|trâu||caterpillar}}, {{m|vi|sừng}} and {{m|vi|trừng||horn}}. See {{m|vi|giòi||maggot}}, {{m|vi|giữa||middle}} for other instances of mainstream Vietnamese ‹gi› from initial ''*k-r''.

===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}

===Adjective===
{{vi-adj|[[𦓅]], [[𫅷]]}}

# {{lb|vi|of lifeforms}} [[old]]; compare {{m|vi|cũ|pos=of objects}}
#: {{uxi|vi|nhường bước người '''già'''|to make way for the elderly}}
#: {{uxi|vi|gà '''già''' thịt dai|old chickens have leathery meat}}
#: {{uxi|vi|cây '''già'''|old tree}}
# having the characteristics of appearances of an old person although not that old
#: {{uxi|vi|mặt '''già'''|an old face (ie. with wrinkles)}}
#: {{uxi|vi|tìm một chị tiếng '''già''' để đóng vai bà lão|to search for a woman with an old voice to voice the role of an old woman (ie. someone whose voice sounds like an old person)}}
#: {{uxi|vi|lo nghĩ nhiều nên '''già''' trước tuổi|to worry too much and thus age too soon}}
# [[veteran]], [[experienced]], [[longtime]]
#: {{uxi|vi|thầy '''già'''|veteran teacher}}
#: {{uxi|vi|Cậu ta là bạn '''già''' của mình.|He is my old friend.}}
#: {{ux|vi|Chưa đến bốn mươi nhưng đã '''già''' tuổi Đảng.|Not even 40 years old but already a Party veteran.}}
# [[overripe]]
#: {{uxi|vi|cau '''già'''|overripe areca nut}}
#: {{uxi|vi|bầu '''già'''|overripe gourd}}
# [[above average]], more than normal
#: {{uxi|vi|nước nóng '''già'''|too-warm water}}
#: {{uxi|vi|dọa '''già''' dọa non|to [[scare]] someone and make them [[give in]]}}
#: {{uxi|vi|nước ô-xi '''già'''|[[hydrogen peroxide]]}}
# slightly [[excessive]], [[over]]
#: {{uxi|vi|'''già''' một thước|over by one meter}}
#: {{uxi|vi|lấy '''già''' một đấu|scoop just over one dou}}

