giái.raw:
===Etymology===
See {{m|vi|trái}} for the etymology, see {{m|vi|giai}} for the sound change. This is the form from the inland dialects, with the form {{m|vi|lái}} presented in the coastal areas (see {{m|vi|lái tim}}). Displaced by {{m|vi|quả}} some time before the colonial period, probably partly due to the homophony with {{m|vi|dái||testicles}}.

Some compounds with the Southern form {{m|vi|trái}} later spread from the South and were adopted by Northern speakers.

