giặc.raw:
===Etymology===
{{vi-etym-sino|賊||hv=n|tặc}}. Cognate with {{cog|scb|-}} [Rục] ''kəcʌ́ːk''.

Attested as {{m|mkh-mvi|giạc}} in the ''Dictionarium Annamiticum Lusitanum et Latinum'' (1651). 

The figurative sense was coined by Hồ Chí Minh:
* {{quote-journal|vi|date= 24 June 1948|origdate= 11 June 1948|author=Hồ Chí Minh|title=Lời kêu gọi thi đua ái quốc|trans-title=Appeal for Patriotic Emution|journal=Báo Cứu quốc|trans-journal= National Salvation|volume=968|passage=Mục đích Thi đua ái quốc là: ''Diệt '''giặc''' đói, Diệt '''giặc''' dốt, Diệt '''giặc''' ngoại xâm.''|translation=The objectives of patriotic Emulation are: ''Destroying the '''enemy''' that is hunger, Destroying the '''enemy''' that is ignorance, Destroying invading foreign '''enemies'''.''}}

===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}

===Noun===
{{vi-noun|[[弋]], [[賊]]}}

# {{lb|vi|collective}} [[enemy]], [[invader]], [[aggressor]]
#: {{coi|vi|'''giặc''' ngoại xâm|foreign '''invaders'''}}
#: {{ux|vi|'''giặc''' đến nhà, [[đàn bà]] cũng đánh|when '''invaders''' come, even women fight}}
# {{lb|vi|figurative}} widespread [[issue]] that [[ravage]]s the [[country]]
#: {{coi|vi|'''giặc''' dốt|illiteracy}}
#: {{coi|vi|'''giặc''' đói|famine}}
#: {{coi|vi|'''giặc''' dịch|pandemic}}
#* {{quote-web|1=vi|url=https://www.tuoitrephuyen.vn/chu-tich-ho-chi-minh/hoc-bac-diet-giac-doi-180.html|year=2017|title=Học Bác diệt "giặc đói"|site=Tuổi trẻ Phú Yên|passage=Dẫu rằng "'''giặc''' đói" không còn, nhưng "'''giặc''' nghèo" vẫn đang hiện hữu.|translation=Although hunger is a thing of the past, poverty is still an issue.|accessdate=29 February 2024|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20240229015423/https://www.tuoitrephuyen.vn/chu-tich-ho-chi-minh/hoc-bac-diet-giac-doi-180.html|archivedate=29 February 2024}}

