giở.raw:
===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|vi|lở|q1=Northern Vietnam, coastal dialects, probably obsolete}}
* {{alt|vi|trở|q1=originally Central Vietnam, Southern Vietnam, now widely used}}

===Etymology===
{{doublet|vi|trở}} in modern written Vietnamese.

Originally the (inland) Northern form (see {{m|vi|giai}} for the sound change), now widely used in the written language. In the meaning "to turn, to change", its usage has been eclipsed by the Central-Southern form {{m|vi|trở}}.

Attested in ''Phật thuyết đại báo phụ mẫu ân trọng kinh'' (佛說大報父母恩重經) as {{m|vi|𫶷}}, composed of {{ltc-l|巴}} + {{ltc-l|呂}} (modern [[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|ba}} {{m|vi|lã}}) and {{ltc-l|呂}} (modern [[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|lã}}). Attested as Northern {{cog|mkh-mvi|blở}} in the ''Dictionarium Annamiticum Lusitanum et Latinum'' (1651).

===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}

===Verb===
{{vi-verb}}

# to [[open]] (a book, etc.), to [[unroll]], to [[unfold]]
#: {{ux|vi|'''Giở''' sách, trang 26.|'''Open''' your book at page 26.}}
# {{alternative form of|vi|trở||to turn, to change|from=Northern Vietnam}}
#* {{quote-book|vi|year=1909|author=lw:vi:Phan Kế Bính|title=Nam Hải dị nhân liệt truyện|chapter=Lương-hữu-Khánh|passage=Bà kia y [[nhời]] ấy '''giở''' về làm cơm. Ông ấy mới cầm một con dao to lội xuống ruộng dọn cỏ, chưa đến buổi trưa, đã dọn quang cả 5 mẫu ruộng. Dọn xong, nằm ngủ dưới gốc cây, tiếng ngáy như sấm.|translation=The old lady followed his words and went home to prepare a meal. He took a big machete, wading through the fields to clear all the vegetation; not even noon, he had already cleared five {{l|vi|mẫu}}. Done with slashing weeds, he took a nap in the shade of a tree, his snores were thunderous.}}
#* {{quote-book|vi|title=Sống mãi với Thủ Đô|author=w:Nguyễn Huy Tưởng|year=1961|url={{fullurle:s:vi:Sống mãi với Thủ Đô/Chương 12}}|passage=Tiếng kêu râm ran:<br> - Nó chiếm sở Tài chính rồi! Nó '''giở''' mặt thực sự rồi!|translation=Voices resounded:<br> - They got the Financial building! They had really betrayed us!}}

