gác.raw:
===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}
* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199 (vie)-Penn Zero MSSJ-gác.wav|a=Hanoi}}

===Etymology 1===
{{bor+|vi|fr|garde}}.

Some early attestations are in ''Le Livre du soldat annamite'' (The Book of the Annamite Soldier, 1914), where it is seen in {{m|vi|[[lính]] gác}} and {{m|vi|[[đứng]] gác}}. Latter appeared as an entry in ''Việt-Nam tự-điển'' (1931) with the elaboration "{{l|vi|bởi}} chữ Pháp ⟪garde⟫" (“from the French word 'garde'”).

====Verb====
{{vi-verb}}

