===Etymology 2===
{{bor+|vi|en|hi||hello}}.

Further reinforced/contaminated by the coincidental usage of "two" (see etymology above) fingers when making [[V sign]], therefore Vietnamese speakers would likely make V signs when being told to say "hai"/{{l|en|hi}} when photographed.

