===Etymology===
{{vi-etym-sino|現|now|代|age; period}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}

===Adjective===
{{vi-adj}}

# {{l|en|modern}}
#: {{uxi|vi|Thi văn '''hiện đại'''|Modern poetry}}
#: {{uxi|vi|Lịch sử '''hiện đại'''|Modern history}}

====Usage notes====
* {{m|vi||hiện đại|pos=post-1917}} does not really correspond well with {{m|en|modern}} in the sense of "modern period", similarly to {{cog|ja|現代|tr=gendai|pos=post-1945}}. In historical classifications, it is usually preceded by {{m|vi|cận đại}}, roughly "pre-modern" (in textbooks, generally from the late 16th century to 1917), which could also translate to "modern", similarly to {{cog|ja|近代|tr=kindai|pos=late 19th century to 1945}}.
* {{m|vi||hại điện|lit=harmful for electrical use}} is a common jocular phrase to ridicule things that are said to be "modern", as in "new and technologically advanced." It is a result of {{m|vi|nói lái}}.
* Not to be confused with {{m|vi|hiện tại}}.

