===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}

===Etymology 1===
{{vi-etym-sino|或|or, either}}.

====Conjunction====
{{vi-conj}}

# [[or]]
# [[either]]
#: {{ux|vi|'''Hoặc''' chịu phạt '''hoặc''' báo phụ huynh, chọn đi.|'''Either''' you accept the penalty '''or''' I will have to inform your parents of what you did, your choice.}}

====Pronoun====
{{vi-pronoun}}

# {{lb|vi|literary}} [[some]]; [[someone]]; [[something]]
#* {{quote-book|vi|year=1752|title=古珠法雲佛本行語録<tr:Cổ Châu Pháp Vân Phật bản hạnh ngữ lục>|url=https://archive.org/details/co-chau-phap-van-phat-ban-hanh-ngu-luc/page/n9/mode/2up|page=11a|passage='''或'''浪身㐌化。'''或'''浪𠰺渃恪。|tr='''Hoặc''' rằng thân đã hoá. '''Hoặc''' rằng dạy nước khác.|t='''Some''' say [he had] manifested another body. '''Someone''' said [he went to] teach in another country.}}
#* {{quote-book|vi|year=1837|title=vi:書經大全節要演義<tr:Thư kinh đại toàn tiết yếu diễn nghĩa>|trans-title=An Explanation (in Vietnamese) of the Selected Essentials from the Complete Collection of the Book of Documents|chapter=vi:無逸<tr:Vô Dật><t:Against Luxurious Ease>|volume=5|page=33b|url=https://archive.org/details/thu-kinh-dai-toan-tiet-yeu-dien-nghia-q.-5/Th%C6%B0%20kinh%20%C4%91%E1%BA%A1i%20to%C3%A0n%20ti%E1%BA%BFt%20y%E1%BA%BFu%20di%E1%BB%85n%20ngh%C4%A9a%20%28%E6%9B%B8%E7%B6%93%E5%A4%A7%E5%85%A8%E7%AF%80%E8%A6%81%E6%BC%94%E7%BE%A9%29%20q.%205/page/n67/mode/2up|passage=典蒸𨄑𡮈𨄑𢀲，𫽄固埃意𱺵'''或'''固𪬡。丕𤤰高宗蒸享祚茹渃，𠄼𨒒𥛭𫡦𢆥。|tr=Đến chưng bậc nhỏ bậc lớn, chẳng có ai ấy là '''hoặc''' có hờn. Vậy vua Cao Tông chưng hưởng tộ nhà nước, năm mươi lẻ chín năm.|t=As for the people of low and high rank, there was no one who was '''someone''' that had resentment. Therefore, King Gao Zong, in enjoying the state’s throne, [reigned for] fifty and nine years.}}

===Etymology 2===
{{vi-etym-sino|惑}}.

====Verb====
{{vi-verb}}

# to [[mislead]], to [[confuse]]
#* {{quote-book|vi|year=1774|title=新編傳奇漫錄增補解音集註<tr:Tân biên Truyền kỳ mạn lục tăng bổ giải âm tập chú>|trans-title=Newly Edited Collection of Truyền kỳ mạn lục with Supplemented Annotations, Phonetic Explanations, and Collected Notes|volume=4|page=12b|url=https://archive.org/details/tan-bien-truyen-ky-man-luc-tang-bo-giai-am-tap-chu-vhv.-1491/page/n247/mode/2up|passage=矣喂！甚丕蒸嫌事疑意，㐱種坤別麻易'''惑'''。|tr=Hỡi ôi! Thậm vậy chưng hiềm sự ngờ ấy, chỉn giống khôn biết mà dễ '''hoặc'''.|t=Alas! How serious is the ambiguity of things that seem alike, difficult to discern, yet easy to be '''confused'''.}}

=====Usage notes=====
* In the sense of “or”, ''hoặc'' conveys a sense of exclusivity of options (if A, then not B, and vice versa), and is rarely used in interrogative sentences. However, nowadays the distinction is not as clear, thus {{m|vi|hay}} and ''hoặc'' can be seen used interchangeably in many situations.

