====Noun====
{{vi-noun|[[𬗢]], [[纙]], [[羅]], [[𱺵]]}}

# [[fine]] [[silk]]
#* {{RQ:Nguyen Trai Quoc am thi tap|chapter=Ngôn chí 言志 3
|passage={{vi-ruby|𩛷咹油固𦼞㙁<br/>襖默奈之錦羅|Bữa ăn dù có dưa muối Áo mặc nài chi gấm '''là'''.}}
|translation=[I don't mind] Even if my meals only have pickles [on the side],<br/> [and] I have no reason to demand good silk for clothing.}}

=====Derived terms=====
