Attested as {{m|mkh-mvi|blỏ}} in the ''Dictionarium Annamiticum Lusitanum et Latinum'' (1651).<ref>{{cite book|la,pt|title=Dictionarium Annnamiticum{{sic}} Lusitanum, et Latinum|urls=[[s:vi:Từ điển Việt–Bồ–La|[1]]]|entry=ls:vi:[[Từ điển Việt–Bồ–La/B|blỏ]]|year=1651|author=w:Alexandre de Rhodes|publisher=w:Propaganda Fide|location=Rome}}</ref> Possibly related to {{m|vi|lò|pos=adjective}} and {{m|vi|ló}}.

