{{vi-IPA}}

===Adjective===
{{vi-adj|魯}}

# Of [[nose]] or [[physique]]: [[prominent]]
#: {{uxi|vi|mũi '''lõ'''|long and narrow nose; prominent nose}}
#: {{uxi|vi|gầy '''lõ''' xương|bony; very skinny}}

====Usage notes====
* ''Lõ'' is almost exclusively used to describe someone's nose, and is usually associated with Westerners or {{l|en|Caucasian|Caucasians|id=racial classification}}.
* Consequently, the word could still be understood as describing some person's nose in situations where it is used to modify a noun or pronoun representing the said person, i.e. "Tây lõ" to mean "big-nosed Westerner".

