Compare the Trans-Himalayan/Sino-Tibetan root that gave rise to {{ncog|och|-}} {{och-l|以|tr={{IPAfont|*ləʔ}}}} (B-S) (SV: {{m|vi|dĩ}}), which might just be coincidence or indicative of deeper borrowing further back diachronically.

