===Etymology===
Attested as {{m|mkh-mvi|lớn}}, {{m|mkh-mvi|mlớn}}, in the ''Dictionarium Annamiticum Lusitanum et Latinum'' (1651).

===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}
* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199 (vie)-Penn Zero MSSJ-lớn.wav|a=Hanoi}}
* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199 (vie)-Jessica Nguyen (Pamputt)-lớn.wav|a=Ho Chi Minh City}}

===Adjective===
{{vi-adj|[[𡘯]], [[𢀲]], [[𱜝]], [[𣁔]], [[𣁔]], [[吝]]}}

# [[big]]; [[large]]
#: {{syn|vi|to|bự}}
#: {{ant|vi|nhỏ|bé}}
#* {{quote-book|vi|author=w:Hồ Biểu Chánh|title=Dây oan|year=1935|chapter=III|passage=- Bẩm, chồng tôi buôn bán '''lớn''', việc lời {{l|vi|lỗ|lổ}} tôi hiểu sao được. Lại bên Tàu có {{l|vi|thơ}} qua thơ lại hoài, tôi không biết chữ Tàu, tôi có hiểu đâu.|translation=- Dear Sir, my husband has a '''big''' business, I can't keep track of how it was doing. And he kept his correspondence with his partners in China; I don't know Chinese characters so I can't read anything.}}
# [[grown-up]]; [[adult]]
#: {{ant|vi|nhỏ|bé}}
# [[great]]; [[grand]]
#: {{ant|vi|nhỏ|bé}}
#: {{uxi|vi|chí '''lớn'''|grand ambitions}}
#: {{uxi|vi|2 '''lớn''' hơn 1|2's greater than 1}}
# [[loud]]
#: {{ant|vi|nhỏ|bé}}

====Usage notes====
* In many situations, this word and {{m|vi|to}} are interchangeable:
*: {{uxi|vi|nhà '''to''' mà chẳng ai ở|a big house where no one lives in}}
*: {{uxi|vi|căn nhà '''lớn''' trên đỉnh đồi|a big house on top of the hill}}
* However, ''lớn'' is also specifically used for things or concepts that are intangible or not visually perceivable, although not necessarily abstract nouns:
*: {{uxi|vi|nguồn cảm hứng '''lớn'''|a big inspiration|q=never *nguồn cảm hứng to}}
*: {{uxi|vi|dấu hỏi '''lớn'''|a big question (figure of speech)}}
*: {{uxi|vi|dấu hỏi to|a big question mark (like one written on a sheet of paper)}}

====Derived terms====
