===Etymology 2===
Might be simply a semantic extension/semantic alteration of the etymology above. If this is indeed true, this word has the same origin as {{m|vi|giở||to turn over, to unfold}} and {{m|vi|trở||to turn}}; these three forms would be from three dialectal areas (''giở'' from inland Northern Vietnam, ''lở'' from coastal Northern Vietnam, and ''trở'' is the Central-Southern form), but had all entered modern written Vietnamese, albeit with altered semantics.

