#* {{quote-web|vi|work= Báo Giao Thông|trans-work= Transportation and Traffic Newspaper|year= 2017|author= H.T.
|titleurl= https://www.baogiaothong.vn/them-nha-co-nang-d217674.html|title= Thềm nhà có nắng|trans-title= The Veranda's Floor with Sunshine
|text= Cánh đồng cả tuổi thơ cô in hằn biết bao kỷ niệm, từ những ngày mùa gặt theo chân mẹ ra đồng bắt những con '''muỗm''' béo ngậy nướng ăn, chờ những đống lúa tuốt xong là nhảy lên đống rơm mới thơm nức lăn lộn cùng lũ trẻ.
|translation=The fields of her whole childhood were deeply imprinted with, who knows, how many memories: from those days in harvest times when she followed her mother's footsteps out into those fields to catch, roast, and eat plump, fatty '''bush-crickets'''; when she waited for the exact moment when the freshly-threshed rice-stalks had just been turned into heaps of fragrant straws for her to jump on and roll in along with other children.}}

===Etymology 2===
{{rfe|vi}}

====Noun====
