{{picdic/vi/Gesicht}}
From {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*-maːʔ}}, from {{inh|vi|mkh-pro|-}}. Cognate with {{cog|tou|-}} [Cuối Chăm] ''maː³'' ("cheek"), {{cog|aem|-}} ''umæːʔ'' ("gills"), {{cog|mkh-pal-pro|*cəmaːʔ||cheek}} (whence {{cog|ril|-}} [Sak] ''sᵊmɑʔ²''), {{cog|aav-nic-pro|*samaː}} (whence {{cog|ncb|-}} [Nancowry] {{m|cbs|shama||jaw}}) and {{cog|bfw|-}} ''ǰama'' ("jaw").

This item might be an infixed form (nominalizing {{m|aav-pro|*-m-}}) of the root {{m|aav-pro|*ca(ː)ʔ||to eat}}, as suggested in Sidwell (2018).

====Noun====
{{vi-noun|cls=cái|[[𦟐]]}}

