mày hả mạy.raw:
===Alternative forms===
* {{vi-l|mày hả mày}}

===Etymology===
An emphatic expression of anger by reduplicating the hostile usage of the second person pronoun {{m|vi|mày}}, with the particle {{m|vi|hả}} encliticized in between.

Tonal behavior-wise, this is reminiscent of trisyllabic reduplication of the {{m|vi|tuốt}} > {{m|vi|tuốt tuồn tuột}} type.

===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}

===Interjection===
{{vi-interj|head=[[mày]] [[hả]] mạy!}}

# {{lb|vi|emphatic|usually said while inflicting violence to the other party}} [[ask for it|you asked for it]]! [[eat this]]!
#: {{ux|vi|'''Mày hả mạy'''! Tao cho mày ra bã luôn.|'''Eat this''', you fucking cunt! You are not gonna leave this in one piece.}}

====See also====
* {{l|vi|mày hả bưởi}}
* {{l|vi|chết mày chưa, cho mày chừa}}

