* {{cite-web|vi|date= 27 February 2009|work= Quê Hương Online|title= Giải Thích Thành Ngữ: Mạt Cưa Mướp Đắng|trans-title= Explaining the Idiom: Saw-dust and Bitter-melon|url= http://quehuongonline.vn/giai-thich-thanh-ngu-tuc-ngu/giai-thich-thanh-ngu-mat-cua-muop-dang-8810.htm|archiveurl= https://web.archive.org/web/20240221004341/http://quehuongonline.vn/giai-thich-thanh-ngu-tuc-ngu/giai-thich-thanh-ngu-mat-cua-muop-dang-8810.htm}}

