====Usage notes====
* Unlike other cardinal numbers, the ordinal phrasal expression for ''một'' is not *''thứ một'', but {{m|vi|[[thứ]] [[nhất]]||{{l|en|first}}}}. Alternatively, "first" can also be translated as {{m|vi|đầu tiên||{{l|en|foremost}}}}.
