#* {{quote-book|vi|year=1912|author={{w|Phạm Duy Tốn|Thọ An}} (editor)|title=Tiếu lâm An Nam|chapter=Được cả đơn liền kép|volume=II|text=Anh kia nghe thấy thế, vội vàng chui ra, chạy về. Chẳng may sân nhà có lắm rêu, trượt, '''ngã''' đánh « huỵch » một cái bằng {{l|vi|giời}} giáng.|t=The man heard her words, hastily crawled out [of his hiding] to run home. Unfortunately, as the mossy yard was too slippery, he '''fell''' with a "thud" as if he just got dropped from heaven.}}
# {{lb|vi|Southern Vietnam|of a generally inanimate object}} to [[collapse]] onto the [[ground]] and [[remain]]s there for a period of time
#: {{syn|vi|đổ|sụp}}
#: {{ux|vi|Coi chừng cây nó '''ngã'''!|Watch out for the falling tree!}}
#: {{ux|vi|Ê, cây móc đồ '''ngã''' mất tiêu rồi kìa.|Hey, your hanger stand has collapsed (and it's still on the ground).}}
#* {{quote-book|vi|termlang=vi|year=1837|title=vi:書經大全節要演義<tr:Thư kinh đại toàn tiết yếu diễn nghĩa>|trans-title=An Explanation (in Vietnamese) of the Selected Essentials from the Complete Collection of the Book of Documents|chapter=vi:金縢<tr:Kim Đằng><t:Metal-bound Coffer>|volume=5|page=2b|url=https://www0.kfzimg.com/sw/kfz-cos/kfzimg/fafadadd/6a5f09acddbcaf0c_b.jpg|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20260728181729/https://www0.kfzimg.com/sw/kfz-cos/kfzimg/fafadadd/6a5f09acddbcaf0c_b.jpg|passage=𬁒秋，奇時𬁒𣜾及𢵷，𡗶奇𳊉𩅀黙𩙌，穭歇'''我'''，核枯𢀲（⿰扌吐）。|tr=Mùa thu, cả thời mùa chưa kịp cắt, trời cả sấm chớp mặc gió, lúa hết '''ngã''', cây gỗ lớn nhổ.|t=In the autumn, before the entire season's harvest could be reaped, great storm of thunder and lightning struck, accompanied by winds. All the grain was '''knocked''' down, and large trees were uprooted.}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{col3|vi|té ngã|ngã ngửa|ngã gục|gục ngã|ngã quỵ|ngã xuống|ngã ngựa|sa ngã|vấp ngã|quật ngã|ngã ngũ|ngã lòng|ngã đè|ngã khuỵu}}

