{{vi-noun}}

# {{lb|vi|linguistics}} {{short for|vi|thanh ngã}}

===Etymology 2===
{{rfe|vi|{{vi-etym-sino|丫|a fork in a path|hv=n|[[a]], [[nha]]}}}}
From {{inh|vi|mkh-pro|*d₁ngah||crossroads}}.

====Noun====
{{vi-noun}}

# {{lb|vi|almost always in compounds with an integer greater than 2}} an {{l|en|intersection}}
#: {{uxi|vi|'''ngã''' ba|a three-way intersection; a fork}}
#: {{uxi|vi|'''ngã''' tư|a crossroads}}
