nhất.raw:
===Alternative forms===
* {{l|vi|nhứt}}
* {{l|vi|nhít}}

===Etymology===
{{vi-etym-sino|一|{{l|en|one}}}}.

The ‹nh-› is from {{IPAfont|ʔj-}}, which was perceived as the implosive {{IPAfont|*ʄ-}} then developed into {{IPAfont|ɲ-}} as implosives nasalized: {{IPAfont|ʔjit > *ʄit > ɲit}}. For a similar case of development of Middle Chinese {{IPAfont|ʔj-}}, compare {{m|vi|nhân}}, from {{ltc-l|因}}. See Ferlus (2009) for details.

Sino-Vietnamese shows fairly systemic contrast between characters belonging to Chongniu III and IV rime groups with certain initials: ''nhất'' (< {{IPAfont|*ʔj-}} < {{ltc-l|一}}) vs. {{m|vi|ất}} (< {{IPAfont|*ʔ-}} < {{ltc-l|乙}}), {{m|vi|dân}} (< {{IPAfont|*j-}} < {{IPAfont|*mj-}} < {{ltc-l|民}}) vs. {{m|vi|mân}} (< {{IPAfont|*m-}} < {{ltc-l|珉}}), {{m|vi|tần}} (< {{IPAfont|*bj-}} < {{ltc-l|嬪}}) vs. {{m|vi|bần}} (< {{IPAfont|*b-}} < {{ltc-l|貧}}). The first character of each pair belongs to Chongniu IV group and shows clear palatalization in its Sino-Vietnamese reflexes, while the second belongs to Chongniu III and yields simplex initial.

===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}
* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199 (vie)-Penn Zero MSSJ-nhất.wav|a=Hanoi}}

===Numeral===
{{vi-numeral}}

# {{cln|vi|ordinal numbers}} {{lb|vi|of a prize}} {{l|en|first}}
#: {{uxi|vi|giải nhất|first prize}}

====Usage notes====
* Unlike other cardinal numbers, the ordinal phrasal expression for {{m|vi|một||{{l|en|one}}}} is not *''thứ một'', but {{m|vi|[[thứ]] nhất||{{l|en|first}}}}.

===Adverb===
{{vi-adv}}

# {{l|en|the [[most]] in...}}
#: {{syn|vi|hơn cả}}
#: {{ux|vi|Mẹ thương con '''nhất''' nhà.|Mom loves you most.|lit=Mom loves child most in the family.}}
#: {{ux|vi|Nó học giỏi '''nhất''' lớp.|She's the best student in the class.|lit=She studies best in the class.}}
#: {{uxi|vi|đẹp '''nhất''' thế giới|the most beautiful in the world}}
#* {{RQ:Nguyen Ngoc Tu CDBT|chapter=Biển người mênh mông|passage=Người ta buồn '''nhất''', cô đơn '''nhất''' là khi ngủ dậy.|translation=One is sadd'''est''' and loneli'''est''' when waking up.}}
# {{l|en|at the [[top]] of one's [[priority]]}}
#: {{ux|vi|'''Nhất''' nước, nhì phân, tam cần, tứ giống.|First comes water, second comes manure, third comes hard work, and fourth come cultivars.}}
# {{lb|vi|in a competition, or a ranking system}} {{l|en|in the [[first]] [[position]]}}
#: {{uxi|vi|về (thứ) nhất|to finish first}}

===Interjection===
{{vi-interj}}

# {{lb|vi|informal|before someone's name or kinship title}} {{l|en|you are / he/she is so [[darn]] [[lucky]]}}
#: {{ux|vi|Vợ đẹp con ngoan. '''Nhất''' chú đấy nhá!|Beautiful wife, well-behaved children. You're a winner!}}

