nào.raw:
===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|vi|q=Central Vietnam|nà|pos=no diphthongization, only in interjection}}

===Etymology===
Part of ''n''-series of demonstratives, alongside {{m|vi|[[này]]/[[ni]]}}, {{m|vi|nấy}}, {{m|vi|nọ}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}
* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199 (vie)-Penn Zero MSSJ-nào.wav|a=Hanoi}}

===Determiner===
{{vi-determ|[[𱜢]], [[芇]], [[閙]], [[鬧]]}}

# [[which]]
#: {{ux|vi|Đi đường '''nào''' đây?|'''Which''' road do I take?}}
# [[every]], [[any]]
#: {{ux|vi|Ngày '''nào''' cũng như ngày nào.|'''Every''' day is the same.}}
#: {{ux|vi|Món '''nào''' cũng ngon.|'''Any''' dish is delicious.}}

====Usage notes====
* The [[interrogative pronoun]] ''nào'' follows the noun it modifies and denotes a choice which is to be made from a known set of things or people. Note that if ''nào'' follows a noun used together with a classifier, the noun may be omitted in the reply, but the classifier is required.
:: {{uxi|vi|Anh mua quyển [[từ điển]] nào?|Which dictionary are you buying?}}
:: {{uxi|vi|Tôi mua quyển (từ điển) kia.|I am buying that one.}}

====Derived terms====
{{col|vi|nào giờ|nào là|nào ngờ|nỗi nào|thế nào|thảo nào|khi nào|chừng nào|chút nào}}

====See also====
{{vi-demonstratives}}

===Particle===
{{vi-particle|[[𱜢]], [[芇]], [[閙]], [[鬧]]}}

# [[come on]]; come on [[now]]
#: {{ux|vi|'''Nào''' anh em ơi !|Hey y'all!}}
#: {{ux|vi|Nhanh lên coi '''nào'''!|Hurry up will ya! / Stop draggin' your feet!}}
#: {{ux|vi|Chúng ta đi '''nào'''!|Let's go!}}

===Adverb===
{{vi-adv|[[𱜢]], [[芇]], [[閙]], [[鬧]]}}

