===Etymology===
From {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*-niː}}, from {{inh|vi|aav-pro|*niːʔ||this}}. Cognate with {{cog|km|នេះ||this}}, {{cog|pac|nâh||this}}, {{cog|kha|kane}}/{{m|kha|une||this}} and {{cog|caq|në||these things}}. See also {{m|vi|nay||now}} and Central Vietnamese {{m|vi|ni||this}}. Compare  {{cog|lo|ນີ້}} , {{cog|th|นี้}} , {{cog|th|นี่}} and Chinese {{och-l|若|that|id=3}}, {{ltc-l|爾|that}}.

Part of the n-series of demonstratives, along with {{m|vi|nấy}}, {{m|vi|nớ}}, {{m|vi|nọ}}, {{m|vi|nè}}.

