{{vi-IPA}}
* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199 (vie)-Penn Zero MSSJ-này.wav|a=Hanoi}}
* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199 (vie)-Jessica Nguyen (Pamputt)-này.wav|a=Ho Chi Minh City}}

===Determiner===
{{vi-determ|[[尼]], [[呢]]}}

# [[this]]
#: {{ux|vi|Ông '''này''' là nha sĩ đó anh.|'''This''' man is a dentist.}}
#: {{ux|vi|Giờ '''này''' rồi còn lông bông gì vậy?|Why are you idling around at '''this''' time of the day?}}

====Derived terms====
{{col|vi
|cái này
|dạo này
}}

====See also====
{{vi-demonstratives}}

===Adverb===
{{vi-adv|[[尼]], [[呢]]}}

# [[here]]

====Related terms====
* {{l|vi|nay||now}}

===Particle===
{{vi-particle|[[尼]], [[呢]]}}

# {{n-g|prefixes someone's name or kinship title, used to call for their attention}}
#: {{uxi|vi|'''Này''' ai ơi!|'''Hey''' whoever there!}}
#: {{uxi|vi|'''Này''' Lan!|'''Hey''' Lan!}}
# {{n-g|suffixes someone's name or kinship title, usually functions both as a focus marker and signaling a question}}
