#: {{ux|vi|Khoa '''này''', nghe nói em sắp chuyển nhà hả?|'''Hey''' Khoa, are about to move out as I/we've heard?}}

====Usage notes====
* Its usage as a vocative marker similar to English {{m|en|o}} or {{m|en|hey}} is mostly restricted to the literary register and translation.
* Also used in insults similarly to {{ncog|ja|この|tr=kono}}.

