===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*ɗam}}, from {{inh|vi|mkh-pro|*p(ɗ)am}}. Cognate with {{cog|mtq|đằm}}, {{m|mtq|đăm}}, {{cog|km|ប្រាំ}}, {{cog|bdq|pơđăm}}, {{cog|hal|bơdăm}}.

