====Usage notes====
{{m|vi||nếm}} is used of people who only want to know the taste of something using their tongues, for example of cooks. If those people are actually trying a food or a drink to get the full experience (smell, texture, moisture, firmness, etc.), use {{m|vi||[[ăn]] [[thử]]}} or {{m|vi||[[uống]] [[thử]]}} instead.

