* The three items are variously known as {{m|vi|đá||[[rock]]}}/{{m|vi|búa||[[hammer]]}}, {{m|vi|kéo||[[scissors]]}} and {{m|vi|giấy||[[paper]]}}/{{m|vi|bao||[[bag]]}}.

* A shorter version of the chant is also used in Vietnam using the native Vietnamese numbers {{m|vi|một}}, {{m|vi|hai}}, {{m|vi|ba}}.

===Verb===
{{vi-verb|head=oẳn [[tù tì]]}}

