ra.raw:
===Etymology 1===
{{inh+|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*-saː}}, cognate with {{cog|tou|-}} [Cuối Chăm] ''saː¹'' and {{cog|mtq|tha}}.

Attested in ''Phật thuyết đại báo phụ mẫu ân trọng kinh'' (佛說大報父母恩重經, {{circa2|12th cent.|short=1}}) as {{m|vi|亇些}}, phonetic {{ltc-l|個些|id=1, 1}} (modern [[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|cá}} {{m|vi|ta}}) and as {{m|vi|𲉤}}, phonetic {{ltc-l|阿邏|id=1, 1}} (modern [[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|a}} {{m|vi|la}}). Attested as {{m|mkh-mvi|ra}} in the ''Dictionarium Annamiticum Lusitanum et Latinum'' (1651).

====Pronunciation====
{{vi-IPA}}
* {{hmp|vi|da|gia}} {{qualifier|Northern Vietnam}}
* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199 (vie)-Penn Zero MSSJ-ra.wav|a=Hanoi}}

====Verb====
{{vi-verb|[[𱺵]], [[𦉼]], [[𬙛]], [[𪜀]], [[囉]], [[𪡔]], [[𱒁]], [[𠚢]], [[𦋦]], [[𱜂]], [[𬎷]], [[𫥨]], [[𲰲]], [[𲒣]], [[𫥧]], [[𪞷]]}}

# to [[go out]], to [[leave]]
#: {{ant|vi|[[vào]]/[[vô]]}}
#* {{quote-book|vi|year=12th or 15th century|title=佛說大報父母恩重經<tr:Phật thuyết đại báo phụ mẫu ân trọng kinh>|url=https://archive.org/details/phat-thuyet-dai-bao-phu-mau-an-trong-kinh/Pha%CC%A3%CC%82t%20thuye%CC%82%CC%81t%20%C4%91a%CC%A3i%20ba%CC%81o%20phu%CC%A3%20ma%CC%82%CC%83u%20a%CC%82n%20tro%CC%A3ng%20kinh%20%E4%BD%9B%E8%AA%AA%E5%A4%A7%E5%A0%B1%E7%88%B6%E6%AF%8D%E6%81%A9%E9%87%8D%E7%B6%93/page/n59/mode/2up|page=31a|passage=蛇林彦劫，雷'''亇些'''礼𢪀，曵林由旬，礼其[[sắt|可列]]麻其帝，朱泖沚年𲪃，願庄技𠅜経孛。|tr=Thà trăm ngàn kiếp, lôi '''ra''' lưỡi nghỉ, dài trăm do tuần, lấy cày sắt mà cày đấy, cho máu chảy nên sông, nguyền chẳng ghẽ rời kinh Bút.|t=We would rather, for a hundred thousand kalpas, pull '''out''' our tongues, extending them for a hundred ''yojanas'', and have an iron plough run over ourselves, so that our blood flows like a river, than separate from the Buddha's teachings.}}
# {{lb|vi|by extension}} to go [[northwards]] in [[Vietnam]]
#: {{ant|vi|[[vào]]/[[vô]]}}
#: {{uxi|vi|vào nam, '''ra''' bắc|to go southwards and northwards}}
# to be [[release]]d, to be [[publish]]ed, to be [[out]], to [[come out]]
#: {{ux|vi|Phim này mới '''ra''' nè.|Hey, this movie has just '''came out'''.}}
# to [[become]], to [[turn into]]
#: {{ux|vi|Nó chẳng '''ra''' gì hết.|He didn't '''turn out to be''' anybody.}}
# {{lb|vi|slang}} to [[cum]]; to [[spurt]]

=====Usage notes=====
* Sometimes the verb {{m|vi|đi||to go}} is used for emphasis when appended to '''''ra''''', forming {{m|vi|đi ra}} to mean "go even further out". However, this usage may vary from dialect to dialect.
* ''Ra'' is used after an adjective to indicate a positive development of a character or state of a person or thing.
:: {{uxi|vi|Cô ấy [[dạo này]] [[trẻ]] '''ra'''.|She is getting younger these days.}}

