rày.raw:
===Etymology===
Part of the ''r''-series of demonstratives, along with {{m|vi|rứa}}, {{m|vi|ri}}, {{m|vi|ru}}, {{m|vi|sao}}.

Phonologically, like {{m|vi|này||this}}, this is the form with more innovative vocalism, while {{m|vi|ri||like this}} and {{m|vi|ni||this}} maintain the monophthong. Meanwhile, its semantic development parallels that of {{m|vi|nay||now}}.

