sá.raw:
===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*k-raːʔ}}, from {{inh|vi|aav-pro|*kraʔ||path}}. Cognate with {{cog|mtq|khá}}, {{cog|pac|carna}} (through an [[infixed]] form), {{cog|cog|-}} ''kraː'' and {{cog|mkh-pal-pro|*kraːʔ}}.

Possibly cognate with {{cog|och|-}} {{och-l|道|tr={{IPAfont|*[kə.l]ˤuʔ}}}} (B-S) ([[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|đạo}}), and less certainly, {{cog|och|-}} {{och-l|路|tr={{IPAfont|*Cə.rˤak-s}}}} (B-S) ([[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|lộ}}).

====Alternative forms====
* {{alt|vi|xá}}

====Noun====
{{vi-noun|[[詫]], [[垞]]}}

# {{lb|vi|obsolete}} [[road]]
#: {{syn|vi|đường}}
#* {{quote-book|vi|year=13th century|author=lw:en:Trần Nhân Tông|title=Cư Trần lạc đạo phú 居塵樂道賦, Đệ thất hội 第七會|text={{vi-ruby|𭓇隊機祖'''詫'''禅空坤卒別尼|Học đòi cơ tổ, '''sá''' thiền không khôn chút biết nơi.}}|translation=By learning after the fore-elder's methods, on the '''path''' of Zen it shall not be any bit hard to know where.}}

=====Usage notes=====
* ''sá'' is the native Vietnamese word that has been displaced by the more common loanword [[đường]], but remains [[fossilised]] in compounds such as {{m|vi|đường sá||roads}}, {{m|vi|sá cày||furrow}}, the latter of which is again contracted to ''sá'' in the [[idiom]] {{m|vi|trâu quá sá, mạ quá thì|trâu quá '''sá''', mạ quá thì|to be past one's prime|lit= buffalo beyond [the age to plough] the furrow, rice seedlings beyond the time [to sow]}}.

===Etymology 2===
{{rfe|vi}}

====Verb====
{{vi-verb|[[吒]], [[咤]], [[詫]]}}

# {{lb|vi|dated|chiefly|_|in|_|the|_|negative|_|or|_|rhetorical}} to [[mind]], to [[care]]
#: {{syn|vi|quản|màng|lo}}
#* {{quote-book|vi|year=13th century|author=lw:en:Trần Nhân Tông|title=Cư Trần lạc đạo phú 居塵樂道賦, Đệ nhị hội 第二會|text={{vi-ruby|扲戒行敵無常*固'''詫'''求名半角|ids=𱜢|Cầm giới hạnh, địch vô thường, nào có '''sá''' cầu danh bán chác.}}|translation=One keeps precepts and virtues, and defies impermanence, not at all '''caring''' to seek reputation in a [[venal]] manner ({{lit|seek reputation to buy and sell|nocap=y}}).}}
#* {{quote-song|vi|year=1941|title= {{w|Tiếng gọi thanh niên}}|composer= {{w|Lưu Hữu Phước}}|lyricist= {{lw|vi|Huỳnh Văn Tiểng|Hoàng}} {{lw|vi|Mai Văn Bộ|Mai}} {{lw|vi|Lưu Hữu Phước|Lưu}}|artist= The {{w|Voice of Vietnam}}'s Men's and Women's Choir|url= https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sJtShu4dHMU|text= Này anh em ơi, tiến lên đến ngày giải phóng! <br>Đồng lòng cùng đi, đi, đi! '''Sá''' gì thân sống?|t= Brothers and sisters, march forth towards liberation's day!<br>Let's go together! What do we '''care''' about our lives?}}

