From {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*k-roːŋ||river}}, from {{inh|vi|mkh-pro|*ruŋ|*ruŋ ~ ruuŋ ~ ruəŋ|river}}. Cognate with {{cog|mtq|không||river}}, {{cog|bdq|krong||river}}, {{cog|pac|cruang||country; area, river valley}}, {{cog|mnw|ကြုၚ်|tr=krɜŋ||small river, creek}}.

