{{doublet|vi|giang|cảng}}. Related to {{cog|zh|-}} {{och-l|江|tr={{IPAfont|*kˤroŋ}}}} (B-S) ([[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|giang}}), {{och-l|港|tr={{IPAfont|*kˤroŋ}}}} (B-S) ([[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|cảng}}), and {{cog|ace|kruëng}}.

