tam.raw:
===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}
* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199 (vie)-Penn Zero MSSJ-tam.wav|a=Hanoi}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*k-saːm}}. Cognate with {{cog|aem|-}} ''katʰæːm'', {{cog|thm|-}} ''saːm¹'', {{cog|kdt|-}} ''sɛːm'', {{cog|kjg|-}} [Cuang] ''hɛːm''.

Attested in ''Phật thuyết đại báo phụ mẫu ân trọng kinh'' (佛說大報父母恩重經) as {{ltc-l|三|id=1}} (modern [[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|tam}}).

The term was probably already archaic in Northern Old Vietnamese by the time it started to be written down and was only attested in the compound {{m|vi|𱙎三|tr=anh tam||elder brother and younger sibling}}. However, it continues to be used until present days (although also seems to be limited in certain compounds) in the conservative North Central dialects of {{w|Hà Tĩnh province|Hà Tĩnh}}, {{w|Quảng Bình province|Quảng Bình}}, {{w|Quảng Trị province|Quảng Trị}}.

====Noun====
{{vi-noun|三}}

# {{lb|vi|Hà Tĩnh|Quảng Bình|Quảng Trị|obsolete|_|in all other dialects}} [[younger]] [[sibling]]
#* {{RQ:Nguyen Trai Quoc am thi tap|chapter=述興 Thuật hứng 19
|passage=𡶀廊盈𪀄部伴<br/>𩄲客次月𱙎'''三'''
|translation=Mountains as neighbors, birds are friends,<br/>Clouds as guests, the moon is my kin.
|transliteration=Núi [[láng giềng|láng diềng]], chim bầu bạn,<br/>Mây [[khách thứa]], nguyệt anh '''tam'''.}}

