thuồng luồng.raw:
===Etymology===
Uncertain. Either:
* From the proto-form {{IPAfont|/*t<sup>h</sup>luong/}} provisionally reconstructed by {{vi-ref|Trần Trọng Dương (2013)}}. This form might be related to {{cog|ltc|龍}} in some way. The presence of preinitial {{IPAfont|/*t<sup>h</sup>-/}}, however, is left unexplained, or
* From {{der|vi|och|-}} {{och-l|龍|tr={{IPAfont|*[mə]-roŋ}}|[[dragon]]}} (B-S) (SV: {{m|vi|long}}) as suggested by {{zh-ref|Schuessler (2007)}} and earlier by Maspero (1912). The sound change resulting in {{m|vi|thuồng luồng|thuồng}} ({{IPAfont|*C-r- > ‹th-›}}) can be seen in cases like {{m|vi|tháng||month}}, {{m|vi|thông||river {{q|Northeastern dialectal}}}}, {{m|vi|thao||star {{q|Northeastern dialectal}}}}, or 
* {{com+|vi|alt1= thuồng|alt2= luồng}}, two doublets which hail from ultimately {{der|vi|och|-}} {{och-l|龍|tr= {{IPAfont|*[mə]-roŋ}}|[[dragon]]}}, and whose origins must have lied somewhere in coastal North(east)ern Vietnam.
Either way, {{doublet|vi|rồng|nocap=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}

===Noun===
{{vi-noun|cls=con|head=thuồng luồng|[[從弄]], [[𧐺𬠥]]}}

