thằng.raw:
[[File:Attestations of thằng 尙.png|thumb|Thằng is written here as 尙.]]

===Etymology===
Attested multiple times in a Lý dynasty stele dated to '''1209''', ''Báo Ân thiền tự bi kí'' (報恩禪寺碑記; 04102/04103) as {{ltc-l|尚|id= 2}} (modern [[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|thượng}}).<ref>{{cite-journal|zh|author=吳德壽|title=越南喃字形成的發展略程及越南 漢字數位化的一些考量|work=古今論衡|page=33|passage=「 尙（thằng）」是漢字中的常用字，但是在碑文脈絡中指男人，不分貴賤，第十八世紀以後除了自家親近之子弟外，對別人用有輕視之意，這是將漢字做喃字使用之例。|t= 「尙 ([pronunciation:] thằng) 」 is an oft-used character in Han script, yet denoted men - whether noble or humble - in the overall context of the stele inscriptions; since the 18th century, except towards one's own younger kinsmen, using ['thằng'] towards strangers has had a disdainful conntation; this is an example of using a Han graph to make a Nôm graph.|date=April 2015|url=https://www11.ihp.sinica.edu.tw/storage/w2_file/4625UrQDmVw.pdf}}</ref>

===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}
* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199 (vie)-Penn Zero MSSJ-thằng.wav|a=Hanoi}}

