thể dục.raw:
===Alternative forms===
*{{alt|vi|thể-dục}}

===Etymology===
{{vi-etym-sino|體|{{l|en|body}}|育|{{l|en|education}}}}, from {{bor|vi|ja|体育|tr=taiiku}}, clipped from {{m|ja|[[身体]]([[之]])[[教育]]|tr=shintai(-no) kyōiku, {{m|vi|[[thân thể]] (chi) [[giáo dục]]}}}}, calqued from {{der|vi|en|physical education}} by the Japanese writer [[w:ja:近藤鎮三|Kondō Yasuzō]]. An earlier alternative clipping was {{m|ja|身教|tr=shinkyō, thân giáo}}.<ref>{{cite-book|ja|title=体育の歴史と役割|trans-title=The History and Functions of Physical Education|first=Masami|last=Otsuka|url=https://www.jiu.ac.jp/files/user/education/books/pdf/833-07.pdf|publisher=Jodai International University}}</ref> Compare {{ncog|ja|知育|tr=chiiku, tri dục||intellectual education}} and {{m|ja|徳育|tr=tokuiku, đức dục||moral education}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}

===Noun===
{{vi-noun}}

# {{l|en|physical education}}
#: {{synonyms|vi|giáo dục thể chất}}
#: {{ux|vi|Ghét học thể dục quá đi!|I hate PE so much!}}
# {{lb|vi|by extension}} {{l|en|[[physical]] [[exercise]]}}
