* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199 (vie)-Khangtran2008-thừa.wav|a=Hanoi}}

===Etymology 1===
{{vi-etym-sino|剩}}. Its regular reading {{m|vi||thặng}} only occurs in the word {{m|vi|thặng dư||surplus}}, while its irregular reading '''thừa''', which fails to retain Middle Chinese final ''-ŋ'', is acquired from {{zh-l|*承}} (see {{m|vi|thừa#Etymology_4|etymology 4}}). 

Unlikely {{vi-etym-sino|餘|[[left over]], [[extra]]|hv=n|dư|nocap=y}} as suggested by Haudricourt (1954).<ref>André-Georges Haudricourt. "Comment reconstruire le chinois archaïque", ''Word'' 10(2/3). 351–364 (1954). Reprinted (with additions) 1 in ''Problèmes de phonologie diachronique'': 161-182. Translated in 2017 by {{w|Guillaume Jacques}}. [https://halshs.archives-ouvertes.fr/halshs-01631479/document draft]</ref>

====Adjective====
{{vi-adj}}

# [[unneeded]], [[needless]], [[unnecessary]] {{gloss|exceeding what is needed}}; [[redundant]], [[superfluous]]; [[leftover]] 
#: {{syn|vi|dư|dư thừa}}
#: {{uxi|vi|Đời '''thừa'''|'''Redundant''' life {{q|a short story by {{w|Nam Cao}}}}}}
#: {{uxi|vi|động tác '''thừa'''|'''redundant''' action}}
#: {{uxi|vi|còn '''thừa''' thời gian|still [have] time '''to spare'''}}
#: {{ux|vi|trả tiền '''thừa''' cho khách|to return the change to customers|lit= to return '''over'''paid money to customers}}
#: {{ux|vi|'''Thừa''' tiền mà mua cái ngữ ấy!|Is there even '''more than enough''' money to buy that thing?}}
#: {{ux|vi|Lời mẹ dặn không có '''thừa''' đâu!|[Your] mother's advice is not '''redundant'''!}}
#: {{uxi|vi|đồ ăn '''thừa'''|'''leftover''' food}}
#: {{uxi|vi|vải '''thừa'''|'''leftover''' textile}}
#: {{ux|vi|Bài viết này có nhiều câu '''thừa'''.|This article contains many '''unnecessary''' sentences.}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{col|vi|cơm thừa canh cặn|thừa mứa|thừa thãi|thừa sức}}

====Adverb====
{{vi-adv}}

# {{lb|vi|informal}} without [[doubt]]; [[surely]]; [[certainly]]
#: {{uxi|vi|'''thừa''' biết; biết '''thừa'''|to be '''well''' aware}}
#: {{uxi|vi|'''thừa''' hiểu|to '''fully''' understand}}
#: {{ux|vi|Nó '''thừa''' khôn ngoan để hiểu chuyện ấy.|He is '''surely''' smart enough to understand the matter.}}

===Etymology 2===
{{vi-etym-sino|乘}}. Its regular reading {{m|vi||thặng}} only occurs in {{m|vi|thượng thặng||first-degree, top-level {{q|adjective}}; [[Mahayana]] {{q|proper noun}}}}; meanwhile, its irregular reading '''thừa''', which fails to retain Middle Chinese final ''-ŋ'', is acquired from {{zh-l|*承}} (see {{m|vi|thừa#Etymology_4|etymology 4}}).

====Verb====
{{vi-verb}}

# {{lb|vi|chiefly in fixed expressions}} to [[take advantage of]] {{q|an [[opportunity]] or [[situation]]}}
#: {{hypo|vi|nhân}}
#: {{ux|vi|'''thừa''' cơ|to '''seize''' an opportunity}}
#: {{ux|vi|{{l|vi|thừa gió bẻ măng|'''thừa''' gió bẻ măng}}|to '''seize''' an opportunity|lit= to '''take advantage of''' the wind to snap the bamboo shoot}}
#: {{ux|vi|{{l|vi|thừa nước đục thả câu|'''thừa''' nước đục thả câu}}|to '''seize''' an opportunity|lit= to '''take advantage of'''  the murky water to drop the fishhook}}
#: {{ux|vi|'''thừa''' thắng|to '''take advantage of''' a victory}}
#: {{ux|vi|'''thừa''' thế|to '''take advantage of''' a beneficial situation}}
#: {{ux|vi|'''thừa''' dịp|to '''take advantage of''' an occasion}}
#: {{ux|vi|'''Thừa''' lúc đông người, kẻ xấu lẻn vào ăn cắp.|'''Taking advantage of''' the crowd, a bad person sneaked in to steal.}}

