===Etymology 4===
{{vi-etym-sino|承}}.

Its reading '''thừa''' arises from the avoidance of {{w|lang=vi|Trần Thừa}} (陳承)'s naming taboo. 承 originally had the reading '''thằng''' which became '''thừa'''. The characters 丞 (written as 贊 to avoid the taboo) and 乘 (whose last stroke is omitted in texts), which were similar in pronunciation with 承 at the time, acquired the reading '''thừa''' from 承 as well.<ref>{{cite-book|vi|author=Ngô Đức Thọ|title=Nghiên cứu chữ húy Việt Nam qua các triều đại|page=42–45|passage=|year=1997}}</ref> 

