===Etymology 1===
{{vi-etym-sino|實}}.

This reading is due to use of {{m|zh|寔|tr=*}} ([[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|thực}}) in place of {{m|zh|實|tr=*}} and was more widely applied in {{w|Đàng Ngoài}}, while in {{w|Đàng Trong}}, {{m|vi|thiệt}} was (and still is) more common as a free morpheme.

