* {{m|vi|thật|Thật}}, ''thiệt'' and ''thực'' are effectively alternative readings of the same grapheme, but they are preferred in different compounds or expressions. For example, use {{m|vi|[[nói]] [[thật]]/[[thiệt]]|to tell the truth}}, not *''nói thực''; but use {{m|vi|thực tiễn}}, not *''thật/thiệt tiễn''.

