===Etymology 2===
Attested as Northern {{cog|mkh-mvi|blái|gloss=fruit}} in the ''Dictionarium Annamiticum Lusitanum et Latinum'' (1651), from {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*p-leːʔ}}, from {{inh|vi|aav-pro|*pleʔ||fruit}}. 

Cognate with {{cog|mtq|-}} Bi {{m|mtq|tlải}}, {{cog|km|ផ្លែ}}, {{cog|bdq|plei}}, {{cog|pac|culay}}, {{cog|zng|pløː¹}}.

This is originally the Southern form. The North Central form {{m|vi|trấy}} is still extensively used in these dialects. The Northern forms {{m|vi|giái}} (inland dialects), {{m|vi|lái}} (as in {{m|vi|lái tim}}, coastal dialects) are also attested, but now are mostly displaced by Sino-Vietnamese {{m|vi|quả}} when used as a stand-alone noun and by Southern ''trái'' when used as part of compounds (as in {{m|vi|Trái Đất||the Earth}}).

