trùn.raw:
===Etymology===
From {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*p-luːn|*p-luːn ~ *p-ruːn}}, from {{inh|vi|mkh-pro|*(b)ruun}}.

A cognate, but not a descendant, of attested Northern Middle Vietnamese form {{m|mkh-mvi|blun}}, whence modern Northern form {{m|vi|giun}}, now also the common written form. The unattested Central-Southern Middle Vietnamese form can be projected back as ''*blùn''.

Due to the shift {{IPAfont|/n/ > /ŋ/}} from Huế southwards, and the merger of {{IPAfont|<-un>}} and {{IPAfont|<-ung>}} that begins somewhere south of Quảng Nam, this word can be usually pronounced identically to {{m|vi|trùng}}, which is the Sino-Vietnamese reading of {{m|zh|蟲||insect, bug}}, creating a homophonous pair of [[false cognate]]s.

===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}
* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199 (vie)-Jessica Nguyen (Pamputt)-trùn.wav|a=Ho Chi Minh City}}

===Noun===
{{vi-noun|𧉙|cls=con}}

# {{lb|vi|Central Vietnam|Southern Vietnam}} [[worm]] (more specifically an [[earthworm]])

====Derived terms====
{{col3|vi|trùn quế|trùn chỉ|trùn huyết}}

