===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*k-laːk}}. Cognate with Malieng ''kələak⁸''. Related to {{cog|mkh-kat-pro|*kaliiʔ||forehead}} (whence {{cog|brv|-}} ''kali̤aʔ'').

Attested in ''Phật thuyết đại báo phụ mẫu ân trọng kinh'' (佛說大報父母恩重經, {{circa2|12th cent.|short=1}}) as {{ltc-l|略}} (modern [[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|lược}}) and {{ltc-l|畧}}, alternative form of {{ltc-l|略}} (modern [[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|lược}}). Attested as {{m|mkh-mvi|tlước}} in the ''Dictionarium Annamiticum Lusitanum et Latinum'' (1651).

====Alternative forms====
