===Etymology 2===
{{vi-etym-sino|竹}}; this is the Southern form, and {{doublet|vi|trúc|nocap=1}}. For the rime correspondence, compare {{m|vi|phúc}} vs. {{m|vi|phước}}, {{m|vi|phụng}} vs. {{m|vi|phượng}}.

Attested in the ''Dictionarium Anamitico-Latinum'' (1838), ''Đại Nam Quấc âm tự vị'' (1895), and ''Tam Tự Kinh diễn nghĩa'' (1917).

====Noun====
{{vi-noun|cls=cây}}

# {{lb|vi|obsolete}} {{alternative form of|vi|trúc||(kind of) bamboo|from=Southern Vietnam}}
