From {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*p-laːs||[[fathom]]}}, from {{inh|vi|mkh-pro|*laas||to spread; to extend}} (via {{m|mkh-pro|*plaas}}); cognate with {{cog|mnw|ပၠံး|tr=plah||to spread out; to extend}}, {{cog|ril|-}} ''plɑs¹''. Related to {{m|vi|sải}}.

Attested in ''Phật thuyết đại báo phụ mẫu ân trọng kinh'' (佛說大報父母恩重經) as {{m|vi|𬯩}}, composed of {{ltc-l|阿}} + {{ltc-l|賴}} (modern [[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|a}} {{m|vi|lại}}). Attested in ''Dictionarium Annamiticum Lusitanum et Latinum'' (1651) as ''blải''.

