# {{lb|vi|archaic|or|literary}} to [[drown]] oneself
#* {{quote-book|vi|year=late 17th - early 18th c.|title=vi:天南語籙外紀<tr:Thiên Nam ngữ lục ngoại kỷ><t:Peripheral Records of Excerpts from Thiên Nam>|url=https://archive.org/details/thien-nam-ngu-ngoai-ky-ab.-478/page/n87/mode/1up|page=80a|passage=催卞'''酖'''𠇮𫴋滝<br>𩲉花徬拂𦟐紅𰛻汀|tr=Thôi bèn '''trẫm''' mình xuống sông,<br>Hồn hoa phảng phất, má hồng lênh đênh.|translation=She then '''drowned''' herself in the river;<br>Her fair spirit a-fleeting, her rosy cheeks a-drifting.}}

