trọn.raw:
===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|vi|lọn|q=coastal Northern Vietnam, likely obsolete}}

===Etymology===
Attested in ''Phật thuyết đại báo phụ mẫu ân trọng kinh'' (佛說大報父母恩重經; 12th cent.) as {{ltc-l|婆論|id=1,3}} (modern [[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|bà}} {{m|vi|luận}}), {{ltc-l|論|id=3}} (modern [[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|luận}}), and {{m|vi|𫤍}} with phonetic {{ltc-l|論|id=3}} (modern [[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|luận}}). Attested in ''Quốc âm thi tập'' (國音詩集; 15th cent.) as {{m|vi|𫤍}}, composed of {{ltc-l|全}} + {{ltc-l|論}} (modern [[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|toàn}} {{m|vi|luận}}). ({{vi-ref|Trần Trọng Dương, 2014}})

Attested as Northern {{inh|vi|mkh-mvi|blọn}} in ''Dictionarium Annamiticum Lusitanum et Latinum'' (1651) (whence coastal Northern {{cog|vi|lọn}}).

