tui.raw:
===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}

===Pronoun===
{{vi-pronoun|碎}}

# {{lb|vi|colloquial|_|in|_|South Central Vietnam|and|Southern Vietnam|internet slang|_|in other contexts}} {{alternative form of|vi|tôi}}

====Usage notes====
* For Southern and South Central speakers, ''tui'' is the spoken form and therefore written as such except in formal contexts, where {{m|vi|tôi}} is standard. In semi-formal contexts, one might write {{m|vi|tôi}} and still pronounce it as ''tui''.
* ''Tui'' can also be seen used by some Northern and North Central speakers in text messaging and on social media, partially due to the common perception that Southern Vietnamese is "cuter". 

