===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*saːmʔ}}, from {{inh|vi|aav-pro|*tNɕaːm}}. Cognate with {{cog|mtq|thảm}}, {{cog|bdq|tơhngam}}/{{m|bdq|hngam}}, {{cog|mnw|ဒ္စာံ|tr=həcam}}, {{cog|ply|-}} ''saːm⁵³''.

This word occurs in several compounds with the figurative meaning of "many". Compare {{cog|zh|八||eight, many}}, {{cog|ojp|八||eight, many|tr=ya}}. See also the similar usage of "seven" for "many, all" in other languages ({{m|en|seven seas||all the seas}}, {{m|en|city of seven hills||hilly city}}, etc.).

