A {{false cognate|zh|撒|t=to scatter, to sprinkle, to disperse, to spill|pos=[[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|tát/[[tán]]}}|nocap=1}} in contrary to the proposal by the Sinocentric philologist An Chi (2021).<ref>{{cite-web|vi|author=An Chi|date=3-1-2021|title=Lắt léo chữ nghĩa: Sơ bộ nhận xét về bảng "Austroasiatic etyma in Vietnamese" của Mark Alves|url=https://thanhnien.vn/lat-leo-chu-nghia-so-bo-nhan-xet-ve-bang-austroasiatic-etyma-in-vietnamese-cua-mark-alves-1851025614.htm|work=Thanh Niên}}</ref>

====Verb====
{{vi-verb|[[拶]], [[撒]]}}

# to [[bail out]], to [[drain out]] (water), mostly for [[agricultural]] [[purpose]]s
#: {{uxi|vi|'''tát''' nước|to scoop water out quickly}}

