===Etymology===
{{vi-etym-sino|新|new|舉|elect}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}

===Adjective===
{{vi-adj}}

# [[-elect]]
#: {{ux|vi|'''Tân cử''' tổng thống bắt đầu chọn các bộ trưởng.|The president-elect is beginning to choose his/her cabinet secretaries.}}

====Usage notes====
Traditionally, this word precedes the noun that it modifies, for example {{m|vi|tân cử tổng thống|lit=president-elect}}. By contrast, the usual order in Vietnamese is noun-adjective order, especially when a compound word modifies another compound word. Usage in Vietnam has shifted in favor of noun-adjective order, i.e., {{m|vi|tổng thống tân cử}}. However, {{m|vi|tân tổng thống}} remains common.

