#: {{ux|vi|Vụ án xảy ra '''tại''' đường số 9.|The crime took place '''on''' 9th Street.
}}
# {{lb|vi|colloquial}} to be [[because of]]; to be [[due to]]
#: {{syn|vi|do|bởi}}
#: {{ux|vi|Lỗi '''tại''' ai đây? Lỗi '''tại''' tôi.|Whose fault is this? It's my fault.}}
#: {{ux|vi|'''Tại''' số cả thôi.|It '''is''' all '''because of''' luck.}}

=====Usage notes=====
* ''Tại'' is not frequently used in colloquial Vietnamese with the sense "at; in; on". It's only often utilized to somewhat emphasize the place mentioned in the sentence.
*: {{ux|vi|Lấy giấy báo '''tại''' trường nha.|You go get the notice '''at''' school [not anywhere else].}}
* ''Tại'' can be used instead of {{m|vi|ở}} before specific adverbials of place, similarly to the English {{m|en|at}}.

