tới.raw:
===Etymology===
{{vi-etym-sino|逮|to [[reach]]|hv=n|đãi}}.

Most prepositions in Vietnamese were originally verbs: {{m|vi|cho||to give; for}}, {{m|vi|đến||to come; to}}, {{m|vi|ở||to stay; at, in}}, {{m|vi|lên||to go up; onto}}, {{m|vi|vào||to enter; in, into}}, {{m|vi|theo||to follow; according to}}, {{m|vi|về||to return; about}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}
* {{audio|vi|Vi-hanoi-m-tới.ogg|a=Hanoi}}

===Preposition===
{{vi-prep|[[細]], [[𬧐]]}}

# [[to]] {{gloss|indicating destination}}
#: {{ux|vi|Ô-tô chạy '''tới''' bến mới đổ khách.|The car went to the station before dropping off its passengers.}}
# [[until]] {{gloss|up to the time of}}; [[until]] {{gloss|up to the time that}}; [[up to]], [[as far as]], [[as much as]]
#: {{ux|vi|Tôi cũng học cho '''tới''' nghỉ hè như các bạn.|I also study until summer break like all of you.}}
#: {{ux|vi|Đi '''tới''' ngã tư kia thì lại hỏi thăm đường.|Go over to that four-way intersection and ask for directions.}}
#: {{ux|vi|Đọc báo '''tới''' khuya mà vẫn chưa buồn ngủ.|[Someone] read the newspaper until late in the evening but still didn’t feel sleepy.}}
#: {{ux|vi|Đạp '''tới''' ba mươi cây số vẫn chưa phải nghỉ.|[Someone] biked 30 kilometers without having to rest.}}

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|to}} {{vi-l|đến}}, {{vi-l|cho đến}}, {{vi-l|cho tới}}
* {{sense|until}} {{vi-l|đến}}, {{vi-l|cho đến}}, {{vi-l|cho tới}}

===Verb===
{{vi-verb|[[細]], [[𬧐]]}}

# {{lb|vi|intransitive|or|transitive}} to [[arrive]] (at)
#: {{ux|vi|Tàu '''tới''' ga lúc tám giờ.|The train arrives at the station at 8 o'clock.}}

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|to arrive}} {{vi-l|đến}}, {{vi-l|tới nơi}}, {{vi-l|đến nơi}}

===Adjective===
{{vi-adj|[[細]], [[𬧐]]}}

# [[next]]
#: {{syn|vi|sau}}
#: {{ux|vi|tuần '''tới'''|next week}}
#: {{ux|vi|Tôi sẽ xuống tàu ở ga '''tới'''.|I’m going to get off the train at the next stop.}}
# {{lb|vi|optics}} [[incident]]; of [[incidence]]
#: {{ux|vi|tia tới|an incident ray}}
#: {{ux|vi|góc tới|an angle of incidence}}

===References===
* {{R:FVDP}}

