From {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*vaːs||to [[broadcast]] ([[rice]])}}. Cognate with {{cog|tou|-}} [Cuối Chăm] ''vɐːl⁶'', {{cog|scb|-}} [Rục] ''vaːl⁶''.

