Unrelated to {{ncog|zh|-}} {{ltc-l|播}} ([[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|bá}}) nor any Austroasiatic word with labial stop initial like {{ncog|km|បោះ}}, {{ncog|kha|bet}}. As shown by the Vietic cognates, Vietnamese ‹v-› here is not the result of lenition.

