vô.raw:
===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}
* {{IPA|vi|[vo˧˥]|a={{w|Vinh}}, {{w|Thanh Chương}}}}
* {{IPA|vi|[vo˧˥˧]|a={{w|Hà Tĩnh}}}}
* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199 (vie)-Penn Zero MSSJ-vô.wav|a=Hanoi}}

===Etymology 1===
Undiphthongized equivalent of Northern {{m|vi|vào}}.

The usage of {{m|vi|vào}} (especially in writing) by speakers of Central-Southern dialects can be attributed to borrowing from Northern dialects. On the other hand, the undiphthongized Southern form with palatal initial latter spread to the Northern and Central dialects as an interjection.

====Alternative forms====
* {{alt|vi|vào|q=Northern Vietnam|pos=with diphthongization}}
* {{alt|vi|dô|q=Southern Vietnam|pos=pronunciation spelling}}
* {{alt|vi|dzô|q=Southern Vietnam|pos=pronunciation spelling}}

====Verb====
{{vi-verb|[[無]], [[𱍺]], [[𠓺]]}}

# {{lb|vi|chiefly|Central Vietnam|and|Southern Vietnam}} to [[enter]]; to [[go into]]
#: {{syn|vi|vào}}
#: {{ux|vi|'''Vô''' nhà lấy con dao cho ba mày làm cá coi cu Thắng.|Thắng boy, '''go inside''' and fetch the knife so that your dad can start preparing some fish.}}
# {{lb|vi|chiefly|Central Vietnam|and|Southern Vietnam}} to [[toast]]
# {{lb|vi|chiefly|Central Vietnam|and|Southern Vietnam}} to go [[southwards]] in [[Vietnam]]
#: {{ant|vi|ra}}
#* {{quote-book|vi|title=vi:里巷歌謠<tr:Lý hạng ca dao><t:Folk Ballads from the Hamlets and Alleys>|url=https://lib.nomfoundation.org/collection/1/volume/26/page/10|page=10a|passage=塘'''無'''䖏乂觥觥<br/>𡶀𩇛渃碧如幀𤳰圖|tr=Đường '''vô''' xứ Nghệ quanh quanh,<br>Núi xanh nước biếc như tranh vẽ đồ.|t=The road '''to''' {{w|Nghệ An}} is winding,<br>With lush mountains and blue rivers, [the scenery is] like those captured in a landscape painting.}}

====Particle====
{{vi-particle|[[無]], [[𱍺]], [[𠓺]]}}

# {{lb|vi|chiefly|Central Vietnam|and|Southern Vietnam}} {{non-gloss|emphasizing sentence-ending particle}}
#: {{syn|vi|vào}}
#: {{ux|vi|Uống cho lắm '''vô'''! Giờ đau đầu!|You drank yourself to death and now you're wondering why you're having a headache!}}
#: {{ux|vi|Mại '''vô'''!|Check it out, guys!}}

====Preposition====
{{vi-prep|[[無]], [[𱍺]], [[𠓺]]}}

# [[in]], [[into]], [[upon]]
#: {{ux|vi|Nhìn '''vô''' nhà coi, có ai hông?|Did you see anyone when you looked '''into''' the house?}}

====Interjection====
{{vi-interj|[[無]], [[𱍺]], [[𠓺]]}}

# [[cheers]]! {{gl|common toast used when drinking}}
#: {{ux|vi|Một, hai, ba, '''dzô'''!|One, two, three, cheers!}}

=====Derived terms=====
{{col3|vi|vô ra|ra vô|vô guồng|vô tròng|vô hòm}}

=====See also=====
