===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*k-paːs}}, from {{inh|vi|mkh-pro|*kpaas||cotton}}. Attested as {{m|mkh-mvi|[[ꞗĕải]], [[ꞗải]]}} in the ''Dictionarium Annamiticum Lusitanum et Latinum'' (1651). Cognate with {{cog|mtq|pái}}, {{cog|bdq|kơpaih}}, {{cog|pac|capaih}}, {{cog|kha|kynphad}}. 

Compare {{cog|sa|कर्पास}} and {{cog|och|-}} {{och-l|布|tr={{IPAfont|*pˤa-s}}}} (B-S), both of which are probably Austroasiatic loans. {{doublet|vi|bố}} (as in {{m|vi|vải bố}}).

