* In Southern regions, ''xà bông'' usually colloquially refers to "laundry detergent" instead of "soap". If you go to a [[general store]] asking for a ''xà bông'', they would give you laundry powder. You should be more specific by asking for a {{m|vi||xà bông tắm|lit=soap for bathing}} if you want a real soap, and for a {{m|vi||xà bông giặt|lit=soap for laundry}} if you want detergent.

====Synonyms====
* {{l|vi|xà phòng}}
* {{l|vi|bột giặt}}

