{{wp}}

===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}
* {{homophone|vi|sôi}}

===Etymology 1===
Ferlus (2007) reconstructed {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*soːj}}, with cognates in the Pong group like Toum ''soːj¹'' and Liha ''saoj¹'', but this is obviously a faulty reconstruction, as simplex initial {{IPAfont|*s-}} would yield {{IPAfont|/t/}} in Vietnamese, never remains {{IPAfont|/s/}}. 

Ferlus (2007) reconstructed other items with {{IPAfont|*tʃ-}}, which yields {{IPAfont|/s/}} in both modern Vietnamese and Pong lects (< Proto-Pong ''*s-''), compare Vietnamese {{m|vi|xỏ}} vs. Toum ''sɔː³'', Vietnamese {{m|vi|xương}} vs. Phong ''siɛŋ¹''; so the reconstruction could possibly be amended to ''*tʃoːj'' instead.

{{rfe|vi|Any possible connections with [[ចំហុយ]]?}}

