ăn xổi.raw:
===Etymology===
{{com+|vi|ăn|xổi|t1=to eat|t2=temporary, short-term}}. Originally referring to the practice of eating vegetables that have been pickled for only a short time.

===Pronunciation===
{{vi-ipa}}

