{{vi-verb|[[咹磊]], [[咹𱓘]], [[咹𤐝]]}}

# {{lb|vi|literally}} to [[eat]] food (usually [[vegetable]]s) that has been [[pickled]] or [[prepared]] for [[immediate]] [[consumption]]
# {{lb|vi|idiomatic|figurative|derogatory}} to [[seek]] [[immediate]], [[short-term]] [[gain]] without [[long-term]] [[planning]]; to be [[opportunistic]] or [[superficial]]
