#: {{ux|vi|Hôm nay họ đi '''ăn tiệc''' ở khách sạn năm sao.|Today they are going to '''attend a banquet''' at a five-star hotel.}}

====Usage notes====
* Compared to {{m|vi|ăn cỗ}}, which usually refers to traditional or family-oriented ceremonial meals, {{m|vi|ăn tiệc}} suggests a more modern, formal, or high-end event (such as a cocktail party, corporate gala, or Western-style wedding).

