đang.raw:
===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|vi|q=North Central Vietnam|đưng}}

===Etymology===
{{vi-etym-sino|當}}, originally the conservative reading, now common and standardized form, of {{m|vi|đương}} as a particle. Compare {{m|vi|tràng}} with {{m|vi|trường}} (長). Unrelated to {{ncog|ms|sedang}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}

===Particle===
{{vi-particle|[[當]], [[当]]}}

# {{n-g|marks the continuous, imperfect aspect of an action or state}}
#: {{ux|vi|Đã làm xong chưa.<br>'''Đang làm'''.|Have you done yet?<br>'''Still working''' on it.}}
#: {{ux|vi|Tao nhớ lúc đó nó '''đang chơi''' ngoài sân.|I think she '''was playing''' in the yard.}}
#: {{ux|vi|'''Đang bận'''. Không có thì giờ đâu mà đi chơi.|I''''m busy right now'''. I don't have time to go out.}}

====Usage notes====
* Unlike {{m|vi|đã}}, the perfective marker, and {{m|vi|sẽ}}, the future marker, ''đang'' is common in colloquial Vietnamese, as are {{m|vi|mới}} and {{m|vi|sắp}}, the near past and near future marker respectively.

