đi.raw:
===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|vi|đê|pos=imperative sentence-ending particle}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*tiː|*diː ~ tiː|to go, to walk}}; cognate with {{cog|mtq|ti}}, {{cog|scb|-}} [Rục] ''tiː²'', {{cog|thm|-}} ''tiː²'' and {{cog|tou|-}} [Cuối Chăm] ''tiː²''.

The similarity to [[移]] ([[Sino-Vietnamese|SV]]: {{m|vi|di}}) is purely coincidental (a [[false cognate]]).

The development of the verb "to go" into an imperative marker is a Sprachbund phenomenon. Wu & Huang (2018) and de Sousa (2022) discuss similar usage of "to go" in the Northern Tai and Sinitic lects of Guangxi in particular ({{ncog|za|bae}}, Nanning {{ncog|yue|去|tr=hy<sup>33</sup>}}, etc.)<ref>de Sousa, Hilário. 2022. The Expansion of Cantonese Over the Last Two Centuries. In: Ye, Z. (eds) ''The Palgrave Handbook of Chinese Language Studies''. Palgrave Macmillan, Singapore.</ref><ref>Yang, Huang, and Fuxiang, Wu. 2018. Central southern Guangxi as a grammaticalization area. In ''New trends in grammaticalization and language change'', ed. Sylvie Hancil, Tine Breban, and José Vicente Lozano, 105–134. Amsterdam: John Benjamins Publishing Company.</ref>

===Pronunciation===
* {{vi-IPA}}
* {{audio|vi|LL-Q9199 (vie)-Penn Zero MSSJ-đi.wav|a=Hanoi}}

===Verb===
{{vi-verb|[[多]], [[𪠞]], [[𠫾]], [[迻]], [[跢]]}}

# to [[go]]
#: {{uxi|vi|'''đi''' đến|'''go''' to}}
#: {{uxi|vi|'''đi''' ngủ|'''go to''' bed}}
#: {{uxi|vi|'''đi''' chợ|'''go to''' the market}}
#: {{uxi|vi|'''đi''' mua sắm|'''go''' shopping}}
# to [[leave]]; to [[set out]]
#: {{ux|vi|Tàu hoả mấy giờ '''đi'''?|What time does the train '''depart'''?}}
#* {{quote-song|vi|year=2007|title=Vẫn tin mình có nhau|author=Quang Vinh; Bảo Thy|trans-title=Still Think We've Got Each Other|text=Thôi chào em, anh '''đi'''. / Vậy thì người '''đi''' đi!|t=Alright, goodbye, I'm '''leaving''' / Then '''leave''', you dummy!}}
# {{lb|vi|vehicles|of people}} to [[go by]]; to [[board]]; to [[get on]]
#: {{uxi|vi|'''đi''' máy bay|'''go by''' plane}}
# {{lb|vi|of|_|vehicles}} to [[go]]/[[run]]/[[travel]]
# {{lb|vi|euphemism}} {{short for|vi|đi [[ỉa]]<t:to shit>,đi ngoài<t:to defecate>}}
# {{lb|vi|Northern Vietnam}} to [[wear]] ([[footwear]])
#: {{syn|vi|mang}}
#: {{uxi|vi|mèo '''đi''' hia|Puss '''in''' Boots}}
# to [[walk]]
#: {{ux|vi|Con anh mấy tháng mới biết '''đi'''?|How old did your child start '''walking'''?}}
# {{lb|vi|slang}} to get [[corrupted]] or [[broken down]]
#: {{uxi|vi|Đồng hồ mà ngập nước lâu thì rồi cũng '''đi'''.|Any watch submerged in water for long enough would eventually '''die'''.
}}
# {{lb|vi|euphemism}} to [[die]]

===Adverb===
{{vi-adv}}

