đây.raw:
===Etymology===
{{rfe|vi|đ-series of demonstratives}}

===Pronunciation===
{{vi-IPA}}

===Pronoun===
{{vi-pronoun|[[低]], [[底]]}}

# [[this]] [[place]] [[here]]
#: {{uxi|vi|Tôi là ai? '''Đây''' là đâu!?|Who am I? Where is this!?}}
#: {{ux|vi|Mày ở đâu ?<br>'''Đây''', bên tay trái mày nè !|Where are you?<br>'''Here''', to your left!}}
# [[this]] [[thing]]/[[person]]
#: {{uxi|vi|'''Đây''' là phòng ngủ.|'''This''' is the bedroom.}}
# [[this]] [[time]] [[now]]
#: {{uxi|vi|cách đây vài năm|A few years from '''now'''}}
# I, me {{gl|having a familiar, or condescending, rude tone}}
#: {{ant|vi|đấy}}
#: {{uxi|vi|Đây không rảnh nhé!|I don't have time for this!}}

====Usage notes====
The [[demonstrative pronoun]] ''đây'' ("here, this") denotes a place, time, person or thing close to the speaker. When denoting a place, ''đây'' refers to either a location or a movement to the location.
: {{uxi|vi|Ông ấy [[làm việc]] ở '''đây''' [[hai mươi]] [[năm]] [[rồi]].|He has been working here for twenty years. (location)}}
: {{uxi|vi|Lại '''đây''' [[xem]] cái này.|Come here and look at this. (movement to the location)}}
The destination for {{m|vi|đi}} in the "''đi'' + preposition + destination" construction can be expressed by ''đây'' ("here") and is treated as a noun.

''Đây'' can serve as the [[subject]] of the sentence containing the [[predicate noun]].
: {{uxi|vi|'''Đây''' là [[cô]] Hà.|This is Miss Hà.}}

===Particle===
{{vi-particle}}

# {{ng|Emphasizes the very thing or person here}}
#: {{ux|vi|Chính hắn '''đây''' chứ không ai khác.|It's ''him'' and no one else.}}
# {{n-g|forms a question expressing uncertainty or doubt}}
#: {{ux|vi|Biết làm sao '''đây'''.|Ah geez, what am I gonna do now?}}
# {{ng|[[sentence|Sentence]]-[[final]] [[particle]] used to point out a place or an event the speaker wants to stress. The place or event can be seen at the moment of speaking.}}
#: {{ux|vi|Máy bay gặp tai nạn ở chỗ này '''đây'''.|The airplane crashed right in this place.}}
# {{n-g|[[sentence|Sentence]]-[[final]] [[particle]] used to refer to the speaker's idea or feeling of existence or presence of something without certain proof}}
#: {{ux|vi|Chị ấy chắc có chuyện gì không vui '''đây'''.|I believe she is unhappy with something.}}

====Derived terms====
{{col3|vi|cách đây|ở đây|tại đây|đây đó|đâu đây|ta đây|trước đây}}

====See also====
{{vi-demonstratives}}

