Compare {{cog|mkh-kat-pro|*tɛʔ||to have sexual intercourse}} (whence {{cog|ngt|-}} ''tɛʔ''). Semantically, compare {{ncog|en|fuck all}}.

The regularly corresponded Vietnamese form would be the less common {{m|vi|đách}}, with ''đếch'' arose through euphemism then became the dominant form. The form {{m|vi|đế}} developed further by dropping final consonant as euphemism, which then again becoming vulgar.

