{{inh+|vi|mkh-vie-pro|*toh}} ~ {{m|mkh-vie-pro|*tuh||to pour}}, from {{inh|vi|mkh-pro|*tuh}} ~ {{m|mkh-pro|*tuəh||to pour}}. Cognates include {{cog|mtq|tố}}, {{cog|bdq|tuh}}, {{cog|zng|-}} ''tuː¹'', also probably {{cog|tea|teuh||rain, shower}} and {{cog|kns|-}} ''tɯh'' ("to fall down").

