====Usage notes====
''Chu'' is the original Hán-Việt reading of this character and related ones according to Thiều Chửu. However, [[:w:Naming taboo|naming taboos]] for [[:w:Nguyễn Phúc Chu|Nguyễn Phúc Chu]] ({{l|vi|[[阮]][[福]][[淍]]}}) led to the reading ''Châu'' being used instead for this character, especially in the south of Vietnam, based on a tradition of ''u/âu'' sound swaps. Currently, both readings are in use. <ref>{{cite-web|url=https://nhacxua.vn/nhung-tu-ky-huy-cua-nguoi-nam-bo/|title=Những từ “kỵ húy” của người Nam bộ|author=Thiếu Khanh|work=Nhạc Xưa Thời Báo|date=2019-07-07}}</ref>

