𠅜.raw:
===Glyph origin===
Phonetic compound ({{m|vi|hội âm}}/{{m|vi|chữ kép}}; {{lang|vi|會音}}/{{lang|vi|𡨸甲}}): abbreviated phonetic {{m|vi|麻|tr={{vi-l|ma}}}} + phonetic {{m|vi|例|tr={{vi-l|lệ}}}}. 

This character was already attested in ''Phật thuyết đại báo phụ mẫu ân trọng kinh'' ({{lang|vi|佛說大報父母恩重經}}) for the ancient form of {{m|vi|lời}} (recorded in {{ncog|mkh-mvi|-}} as {{m|mkh-mvi|mlời}}). It continued to be used until the 19th century, though mostly only in {{m|vi|giải âm}} texts.

See also {{m|vi|𢈱}}, another double phonogram for {{m|vi|lời}} attested in later works.

