𫏾.raw:
===Glyph origin===
Phonetic compound ({{m|vi|hội âm}}/{{m|vi|chữ kép}}; {{lang|vi|會音}}/{{lang|vi|𡨸甲}}): phonetic {{m|vi|車|tr={{vi-l|xa}}/{{vi-l|cư}}}} + phonetic {{m|vi|畧|tr={{m|vi|lược}}}}.

This character was based on the ancient form of {{m|vi|trước}} (compare {{ncog|mkh-mvi|tlước}} < {{ncog|mkh-vie-pro|*k-laːk}}). Its earliest attestations are found in the 15th-century works ''{{w|Quốc âm thi tập}}'' ({{lang|vi|國音詩集}}) and ''Hồng Đức quốc âm thi tập'' ({{lang|vi|洪德國音詩集}}), and it continued to be used until the 20th century in works such as ''Thiên Nam ngữ lục ngoại kỷ'' ({{lang|vi|天南語籙外紀}}; 17th or 18th century), several versions of ''{{w|Truyện Kiều}}'' (including the 1866 and 1871 versions), ''Trinh thử truyện'' ({{lang|vi|貞鼠傳}}; 1875), ''Chinh phụ ngâm bị lục'' ({{lang|vi|征婦吟備錄}}; 1902), and ''Nam quốc phương ngôn tục ngữ bị lục'' ({{lang|vi|南國方言俗語備錄}}; 1914).

===Han character===
{{vi-readings
|rs=車11
|nom=trước-tdcndg;tdcntd;gdhn;takeuchi;btcn
}}

# {{vi-Nom form of|trước|[[before]]; [[in front of]]}}
#* {{quote-book|vi|year=late 15th century|author=vi:騷壇二十八秀<tr:{{w|lang=vi|Tao Đàn nhị thập bát tú}}><t:Twenty-Eight Mansions of Tao Đàn>|title=vi:洪德國音詩集<tr:Hồng Đức quốc âm thi tập><t:Collection of Poems in the National Language of the {{w|Lê Thánh Tông|Hồng Đức}} Era>|url=https://archive.org/details/hong-duc-quoc-am-thi-tap/page/n38/mode/1up|page=39b|chapter=vi:𡽫渃寺<tr:Non nước tự>|passage=𥒥𥔧丸濕丸髙<br>㳥逐泣𨍦泣'''𫏾'''|tr=Đá chồng hòn thấp hòn cao,<br>Sóng giục lớp sau lớp '''trước'''.|t=Rocks are piled high and low.<br>Waves rush in layers, one after another.}}
#* {{quote-book|vi|year=late 17th - early 18th c.|title=vi:天南語籙外紀<tr:Thiên Nam ngữ lục ngoại kỷ><t:Peripheral Records of Excerpts from Thiên Nam>|url=https://archive.org/details/thien-nam-ngu-ngoai-ky-ab.-478/page/n71/mode/1up|page=64b|passage=𥙩𲋘皮鄧堆年<br>福德𠊛'''𫏾'''底傳𠁀𨍦|tr=Lấy nhau vừa đặng đôi niên,<br>Phúc đức người '''trước''' để truyền đời sau.|t=They had been married for just a couple of years.<br>Blessings from their ancestors would be passed down to future generations.}}
#* {{RQ:DTC DTD CPN|line=309-310|passage=䒹蘭𦬑'''𫏾'''𡑝㐌𢲨<br>𦰟蘋箕边𪤄迻香|transliteration=Chồi lan nở '''trước''' sân đã hái,<br>Ngọn tần kia bên bãi đưa hương.|translation=Orchid buds that bloomed '''in front of''' the yard have been picked,<br>The water clovers by the shore send out their fragrance.}}
#* {{quote-book|vi|year=1875|title=vi:貞鼠傳<tr:Trinh thử truyện><t:The Story of the Chaste Mouse>|url=https://archive.org/details/trinh-thu-truyen/page/n7/mode/1up|page=7a|passage=𣋚戈𢵯眜朱連<br>蝒沙'''𫏾'''𩈘報信外㙴|tr=Hôm qua máy mắt cho liền,<br>Nhện sa '''trước''' mặt, báo tin ngoài thềm.|t=Yesterday, my eye twitched continuously.<br>A spider landed '''in front of''' my face, bringing news from the terrace.}}
#* {{quote-book|vi|year=1914|title=vi:南國方言俗語備錄<tr:Nam quốc phương ngôn tục ngữ bị lục><t:Records of the Southern Nation's Regional Adages and Common Sayings>|url=https://lib.nomfoundation.org/collection/1/volume/74/page/7|page=7b|passage=英㛪𱞁'''𫏾'''廊渃𱞁𡢐|tr=Anh em rẻ '''trước''', làng nước rẻ sau.|t=Brothers look down on one '''first''', one's village does after.}}

