𫶸.raw:
===Glyph origin===
Phonetic compound ([[hội âm]]/[[chữ kép]]; 會音/𡨸甲): phonetic 巴 (ba) + phonetic 例 (lệ) or Phonetic compound ([[hội âm]]/[[chữ kép]]; 會音/𡨸甲): phonetic 巴 (ba) + phonetic 利 (lợi). 

Hypothesised to be originally written as (⿱巴利) during the Trần dynasty, but was later changed to "𫶸" (⿱巴例) due to the [[wikipedia:Naming_taboo#Vietnam|naming taboo]] of Lê Lợi (黎利).

